(183518, 10604, 4648, '<td valign="top">You couldn''t prove it by me.  It''s too out of focus for me to recognize it.  The splashes of color around it are just I don''t know what.  Looks like you tried to make it to look like a modern painting.  Am I right.  Not too bad as that.  As a photo I can''t score more than a 2.  PTL</td>', 'You couldn''t prove it by me.  It''s too out of focus for me to recognize it.  The splashes of color around it are just I don''t know what.  Looks like you tried to make it to look like a modern painting.  Am I right.  Not too bad as that.  As a photo I can''t score more than a 2.  PTL', '2003-01-06 09:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(183519, 10572, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great shot except that tree kind of splits the image into two and it is very distracting.</td>', 'Great shot except that tree kind of splits the image into two and it is very distracting.', '2003-01-06 09:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(183520, 10680, 5044, '<td valign="top">Good composition</td>', 'Good composition', '2003-01-06 09:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(183521, 10697, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too much of everything else.  Almost didn''t notice your and your friends.  Should have cropped from just below the sign to just above the mirror.  The building appears to be leaning as it is.  It''s a really neat idea and nice sharp focused photo, just needs a lot of cropping - better execution.  still a 6 PTL</td>', 'Too much of everything else.  Almost didn''t notice your and your friends.  Should have cropped from just below the sign to just above the mirror.  The building appears to be leaning as it is.  It''s a really neat idea and nice sharp focused photo, just needs a lot of cropping - better execution.  still a 6 PTL', '2003-01-06 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(183522, 10693, 5044, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I hope that guy didn''t come beat you up for taking his picture. He doesn''t look like such a jolly fellow.</td>', 'Good capture. I hope that guy didn''t come beat you up for taking his picture. He doesn''t look like such a jolly fellow.', '2003-01-06 09:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(183523, 10656, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo of a beautiful flower wonderfully done.  Could have been cropped down more on the top.  The empty space adds nothing.  But there are better ways to show the sun coming.  Beautiful photo is a 9 but for the challenge it is a 6.  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful photo of a beautiful flower wonderfully done.  Could have been cropped down more on the top.  The empty space adds nothing.  But there are better ways to show the sun coming.  Beautiful photo is a 9 but for the challenge it is a 6.  PTL', '2003-01-06 09:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(183525, 10534, 4648, '<td valign="top">I would have expected surfers for this song.  This is a beautiful sunset.  If there are surfers in the ocean it is too dark to see them.  The one on the shore is also almost missed because of the darkness.  Nice idea just needs lightened up and better execution.  As is it is a 6.  PTL</td>', 'I would have expected surfers for this song.  This is a beautiful sunset.  If there are surfers in the ocean it is too dark to see them.  The one on the shore is also almost missed because of the darkness.  Nice idea just needs lightened up and better execution.  As is it is a 6.  PTL', '2003-01-06 09:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(183527, 10695, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Needs to be lighter and a little sharper.  Realize that is hard to do with the photos already focused the way they are.  Maybe if lightened up they would appear better focused.  Originality is good execution lacks a little.  Still a 6.  PTL</td>', 'Great idea.  Needs to be lighter and a little sharper.  Realize that is hard to do with the photos already focused the way they are.  Maybe if lightened up they would appear better focused.  Originality is good execution lacks a little.  Still a 6.  PTL', '2003-01-06 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(183528, 10480, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the lights in the eye.  How did you do that.  I wish the upper lid had been in focus as good as the rest.  The reflections of the lashes in the eyeball on the right side are awesome.  The details of the eye are aaaaaa.  10, 10, 10.  PTL</td>', 'I love the lights in the eye.  How did you do that.  I wish the upper lid had been in focus as good as the rest.  The reflections of the lashes in the eyeball on the right side are awesome.  The details of the eye are aaaaaa.  10, 10, 10.  PTL', '2003-01-06 09:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(183529, 10476, 5898, '<td valign="top">I realize the train was meant to be blurry, but so is everything else.</td>', 'I realize the train was meant to be blurry, but so is everything else.', '2003-01-06 09:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(183531, 10684, 5898, '<td valign="top">like the idea, the color, but feet should not sit on the bottom of the photograph, leave a little space.</td>', 'like the idea, the color, but feet should not sit on the bottom of the photograph, leave a little space.', '2003-01-06 09:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(183532, 10418, 4510, '<td valign="top">Colour,composition,light all excellent, great shot.</td>', 'Colour,composition,light all excellent, great shot.', '2003-01-06 09:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
