(183534, 10661, 5898, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the idea... I might suggest you have a petal going off the photo to allow the viewer to finish the work in their mind.</td>', 'Love the colors and the idea... I might suggest you have a petal going off the photo to allow the viewer to finish the work in their mind.', '2003-01-06 09:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
