(183537, 10680, 5898, '<td valign="top">good lighting and idea... you might won''t to off-center the pole to the left and see how it looks. When you center main image your eye does not travel around the picture and you miss things.</td>', 'good lighting and idea... you might won''t to off-center the pole to the left and see how it looks. When you center main image your eye does not travel around the picture and you miss things.', '2003-01-06 09:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
