(183547, 10544, 5772, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo for the song title...I like the way the bottom step is darker than the top step with the top step being lit..</td>', 'I really like this photo for the song title...I like the way the bottom step is darker than the top step with the top step being lit..', '2003-01-06 10:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
