(183568, 10656, 5898, '<td valign="top">Crop the flower to you cannot see it all, centering leaves nothing to the imagination.<br/>Lighting good and the angle of the flower and shadow work for you.</td>', 'Crop the flower to you cannot see it all, centering leaves nothing to the imagination.Lighting good and the angle of the flower and shadow work for you.', '2003-01-06 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(183576, 10558, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Good lighting but maybe could have used a bit more. I''m not usually a fan of large borders, but this time it works well with your picture. What is that reflecting in the glasses. A magazine page?</td>', 'Nice picture. Good lighting but maybe could have used a bit more. I''m not usually a fan of large borders, but this time it works well with your picture. What is that reflecting in the glasses. A magazine page?', '2003-01-06 10:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(183577, 10602, 5898, '<td valign="top">Good all around photo and idea. Needs a point of interest to draw in your attention. The tire tracks help... Perhaps a single person walking about a third of the way down the road?</td>', 'Good all around photo and idea. Needs a point of interest to draw in your attention. The tire tracks help... Perhaps a single person walking about a third of the way down the road?', '2003-01-06 10:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(183579, 10371, 5772, '<td valign="top">Although this is a beautiful picture, I don''t feel it represents the song title... Maybe if it was a bridge over running water...</td>', 'Although this is a beautiful picture, I don''t feel it represents the song title... Maybe if it was a bridge over running water...', '2003-01-06 10:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
