(183679, 10349, 917, '<td valign="top">Being closer and having better sharpness would have helped, as would choosing the enrty/exit points of the branch better (e.g. left side needs to enter lower). The leaf in top left and the cropping of the buds at top right are also problems. I''d have fiddled with the coulour levels to try and get the green a bit more zingy.</td>', 'Being closer and having better sharpness would have helped, as would choosing the enrty/exit points of the branch better (e.g. left side needs to enter lower). The leaf in top left and the cropping of the buds at top right are also problems. I''d have fiddled with the coulour levels to try and get the green a bit more zingy.', '2003-01-06 11:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
