(184008, 10625, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the colours of the sky and the softness of the water.  The focus and depth of field is very good.  The picture has a calmness to it - very nice.</td>', 'I love the colours of the sky and the softness of the water.  The focus and depth of field is very good.  The picture has a calmness to it - very nice.', '2003-01-06 16:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(184010, 10389, 4517, '<td valign="top">You have done a great job making an uninteresting subject look very interesting and the border is well thought out too. 10</td>', 'You have done a great job making an uninteresting subject look very interesting and the border is well thought out too. 10', '2003-01-06 16:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(184011, 10671, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  The weather was on your side and the exposure and colour of the photo is lovely - definitely a photo worth keeping.  I like your cropping and have no issue with it, but you could also try this as a long shot of the child - it would probably be very effective also.</td>', 'Nice work.  The weather was on your side and the exposure and colour of the photo is lovely - definitely a photo worth keeping.  I like your cropping and have no issue with it, but you could also try this as a long shot of the child - it would probably be very effective also.', '2003-01-06 16:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(184012, 10653, 4517, '<td valign="top">not sure what it is but its all about colour, which is great.9</td>', 'not sure what it is but its all about colour, which is great.9', '2003-01-06 16:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(184013, 10602, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The first one I''ve viewed so far that I would consider worthy of an album cover (although the challenge didn''t state that as I requirement I''m still considering it).  The title and artist could go at the bottom.  The photo has great atmosphere, colour and focus with no noticeable defects.</td>', 'Great shot.  The first one I''ve viewed so far that I would consider worthy of an album cover (although the challenge didn''t state that as I requirement I''m still considering it).  The title and artist could go at the bottom.  The photo has great atmosphere, colour and focus with no noticeable defects.', '2003-01-06 16:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(184014, 10349, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-01-06 16:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(184017, 10457, 1647, '<td valign="top">You''ve done well to get this shot.  Some of the brightly lit areas are a little harsh on the eyes but I seriously doubt I could have done this well even and I definitely couldn''t tell you how to avoid this.  Nice framing - would work as an album cover.</td>', 'You''ve done well to get this shot.  Some of the brightly lit areas are a little harsh on the eyes but I seriously doubt I could have done this well even and I definitely couldn''t tell you how to avoid this.  Nice framing - would work as an album cover.', '2003-01-06 16:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(184023, 10493, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow - nice sunset.  The clouds are great, the colours are wonderful and the stillness of the ponds are all working for you.  It looks like another photographer in the distance, which in some ways is distracting but in other ways it''s nicely recursive...  A photographer taking a photograph of another photographer, both chasing the same sunset.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow - nice sunset.  The clouds are great, the colours are wonderful and the stillness of the ponds are all working for you.  It looks like another photographer in the distance, which in some ways is distracting but in other ways it''s nicely recursive...  A photographer taking a photograph of another photographer, both chasing the same sunset.  Well done.', '2003-01-06 17:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(184026, 10576, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great work - that''s exactly the type of photo I want to take.  Beautiful subject, great composition, lovely soft colouring, good exposure and even the grey clouds help create the effect.  Plus it could work well as an album cover.  Top score.</td>', 'Great work - that''s exactly the type of photo I want to take.  Beautiful subject, great composition, lovely soft colouring, good exposure and even the grey clouds help create the effect.  Plus it could work well as an album cover.  Top score.', '2003-01-06 17:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
