(184081, 10476, 3317, '<td valign="top">i feel like givin'' you extra points for picking a song that''s cool. nice blur on the train, did you do something to get it reddish like that? teeny bit blurry, but i bet that was the train going by making the ground shake, right? make sure to email the deftones with a link to the results.</td>', 'i feel like givin'' you extra points for picking a song that''s cool. nice blur on the train, did you do something to get it reddish like that? teeny bit blurry, but i bet that was the train going by making the ground shake, right? make sure to email the deftones with a link to the results.', '2003-01-06 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
