(184086, 10659, 3317, '<td valign="top">ever tried moving the camera around silly crazy, making the light sources streaks? if your camera can take long exposures, you could make a ring out of whatever flame you have on hand. sometimes i spell letters out with the moon, it''s fun. johnny cash rules.</td>', 'ever tried moving the camera around silly crazy, making the light sources streaks? if your camera can take long exposures, you could make a ring out of whatever flame you have on hand. sometimes i spell letters out with the moon, it''s fun. johnny cash rules.', '2003-01-06 18:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
