(184089, 10455, 3317, '<td valign="top">really really beatiful, all the delicate details; skin tone, valleys of shade on the bright pillow, sweet smile... real nice creative crop, you get a ten. nina simone''s pretty cool herself.</td>', 'really really beatiful, all the delicate details; skin tone, valleys of shade on the bright pillow, sweet smile... real nice creative crop, you get a ten. nina simone''s pretty cool herself.', '2003-01-06 18:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(184090, 10651, 5964, '<td valign="top">WoW!!!!   I just live this photo! I am partial to pics with kids but this is moving. I really don''t like B&amp;W shots, but it works so well here, it really makes it and the contrast with the figures. Color would just detract from the individuals. Well done! 10.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'WoW!!!!   I just live this photo! I am partial to pics with kids but this is moving. I really don''t like B&W shots, but it works so well here, it really makes it and the contrast with the figures. Color would just detract from the individuals. Well done! 10. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-06 18:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
