(184222, 10465, 3317, '<td valign="top">good job, noticed with a roommate''s cat that black animals are real hard to take pictures of, focus and grain perfect here. good dog.</td>', 'good job, noticed with a roommate''s cat that black animals are real hard to take pictures of, focus and grain perfect here. good dog.', '2003-01-06 19:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(184224, 10685, 6011, '<td valign="top">Nice......very clear</td>', 'Nice......very clear', '2003-01-06 19:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(184226, 10541, 4648, '<td valign="top">This looks like a smooth wall surface with holes in it..  Wish all of it was in focus.  The more I look at it the more it looks like holes.  Took me a minute to figure out why they look like holes instead of rain drops - the shadows on them.  Getting  rid of the shadows would help a lot.   Good idea. Just need better execution.  5 PTL</td>', 'This looks like a smooth wall surface with holes in it..  Wish all of it was in focus.  The more I look at it the more it looks like holes.  Took me a minute to figure out why they look like holes instead of rain drops - the shadows on them.  Getting  rid of the shadows would help a lot.   Good idea. Just need better execution.  5 PTL', '2003-01-06 19:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(184228, 10480, 3317, '<td valign="top">this kinda scared me when it first loaded up. cyclopean. i''m gonna take a picture of it looking at me from my laptop''s screen, it''s super spooky. weird spin on van morrison, i dunno.... but i''m only grading you on the freaky-deaky image, not the song, so strong nine.</td>', 'this kinda scared me when it first loaded up. cyclopean. i''m gonna take a picture of it looking at me from my laptop''s screen, it''s super spooky. weird spin on van morrison, i dunno.... but i''m only grading you on the freaky-deaky image, not the song, so strong nine.', '2003-01-06 19:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(184231, 10472, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, and excelent depiction of the song.  I think it portrays it perfectly.  I need to get me one of these guys. hehe.  The background used is not distracting, your focus and clarity are great and the angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  I think that the lighting really makes the photo.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful photo, and excelent depiction of the song.  I think it portrays it perfectly.  I need to get me one of these guys. hehe.  The background used is not distracting, your focus and clarity are great and the angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  I think that the lighting really makes the photo.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-06 19:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(184238, 10493, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like sunset and sunrise shots!  Is that another photographer with a tripod near where the sun meets the horizon?  I like the way you were able to get some foreground detail without completely blowing out the highlights.  I also like the shape of the water in the foreground.  Nice job!  this is also the song my wife and I danced to at our wedding for the first time!  For that you get a 9!!</td>', 'I like sunset and sunrise shots!  Is that another photographer with a tripod near where the sun meets the horizon?  I like the way you were able to get some foreground detail without completely blowing out the highlights.  I also like the shape of the water in the foreground.  Nice job!  this is also the song my wife and I danced to at our wedding for the first time!  For that you get a 9!!', '2003-01-06 19:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(184241, 10462, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a really pretty shot.  I think it depicts the song well.  Your focus and clarity on the water is simply awesome.  Even in the darkness you can see the detail of the little waves.  You did a great job of leveling the horizon, and the photo is divided very nicely.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really pretty shot.  I think it depicts the song well.  Your focus and clarity on the water is simply awesome.  Even in the darkness you can see the detail of the little waves.  You did a great job of leveling the horizon, and the photo is divided very nicely.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-06 19:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(184245, 10558, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is very well done.  Some may think it is a little dark overall, but I think that conveys the ''at night'' part of the title.  If I were to change anything at all, it would be a little more room beneath the chin.  I usually just ignore added borders, but your white frame really compliments the reflection in the glasses.  this is a great image and I''m giving it a 9.  Good luck!<br/>Smellyfish1002</td>', 'This is very well done.  Some may think it is a little dark overall, but I think that conveys the ''at night'' part of the title.  If I were to change anything at all, it would be a little more room beneath the chin.  I usually just ignore added borders, but your white frame really compliments the reflection in the glasses.  this is a great image and I''m giving it a 9.  Good luck!Smellyfish1002', '2003-01-06 19:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(184246, 10558, 327, '<td valign="top">Love that song. Your futures so bright!!.......I love the photos, the shades......too cool. Fun shot, good lighting.And I wear my sunglasses at night <br/>So I can so I can<br/>See the light that''s right before my eyes! I''m doing two songs at once aren''t I? LOL<br/>Never mind. I pick this in my top three!! Good luck.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Love that song. Your futures so bright!!.......I love the photos, the shades......too cool. Fun shot, good lighting.And I wear my sunglasses at night So I can so I canSee the light that''s right before my eyes! I''m doing two songs at once aren''t I? LOLNever mind. I pick this in my top three!! Good luck. ', '2003-01-06 19:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(184249, 10697, 5475, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of character!  Great idea!  The colors seem a little flat.  Was that an adjustment you made or was it overcast with flat lighting?  Did you try this in black and white?  This would be a fun reshoot with blue cloudy skies to the left!  Your subject placement and crop are excellent!  It''s too bad you can''t get closer to the mirror so that your images are larger in the photo.  Maybe a ladder?  People might wonder what you were doing if you go overboard (as I am doing  rambling on)!!  OK  overall a great idea, great composition, Lots of fun and I give it an 8!  good luck!<br/>Smellyfish1002</td>', 'This shot has a lot of character!  Great idea!  The colors seem a little flat.  Was that an adjustment you made or was it overcast with flat lighting?  Did you try this in black and white?  This would be a fun reshoot with blue cloudy skies to the left!  Your subject placement and crop are excellent!  It''s too bad you can''t get closer to the mirror so that your images are larger in the photo.  Maybe a ladder?  People might wonder what you were doing if you go overboard (as I am doing  rambling on)!!  OK  overall a great idea, great composition, Lots of fun and I give it an 8!  good luck!Smellyfish1002', '2003-01-06 19:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(184250, 10496, 6011, '<td valign="top">Scarey</td>', 'Scarey', '2003-01-06 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(184252, 10629, 3080, '<td valign="top">To get technical on you, it''s the males that have these trains of feathers.  Peahens (female peafowl) do not have the colored train of tail feathers that the peacocks(male peafowl) do.  So technically, this doesn''t depict LADY in red at all,maybe a beter title would be "Dude looks like a lady" lol.  I get the point though, and I''ll let it slide. Just this once.  :)<br/>Your focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are also excelent.  I like how you have taken up the entire frame of the photo with the subject.  It is a very pretty shot, no matter if male or female.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'To get technical on you, it''s the males that have these trains of feathers.  Peahens (female peafowl) do not have the colored train of tail feathers that the peacocks(male peafowl) do.  So technically, this doesn''t depict LADY in red at all,maybe a beter title would be "Dude looks like a lady" lol.  I get the point though, and I''ll let it slide. Just this once.  :)Your focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping are also excelent.  I like how you have taken up the entire frame of the photo with the subject.  It is a very pretty shot, no matter if male or female.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-06 19:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(184254, 10534, 6011, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette, beautiful sunset.</td>', 'Great silhouette, beautiful sunset.', '2003-01-06 19:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(184255, 10498, 5475, '<td valign="top">I bought a glass chess set about two months ago to do shots like this.  I haven''t had a chance to try it out yet, but when I do, I hope I can come up with something this nice!  Your lighting is perfect.  No hotspots, no shadows, just the right amount of subtle reflections.  I believe in the whole good vs evil in the world and I like the way you used frosted white chess pieces to represent ''all good people.''  The only things I can think of to improve would be to crop tighter on the right side to exclude the partial pawn.  I like the cropping on the left side pawn because it feels ''contained'' but there is too little of the pawn on the right  and it seems a little cut off.  I would also play around with the saturation of the yellows to reduce the yellowish brown thin band behind the pieces to the left at the edge of the board.  These two points are fairly minor (actually the yellowish band is pretty much nit-picking).  I like this image and give it a 9! <br/>Smellyfish1002</td>', 'I bought a glass chess set about two months ago to do shots like this.  I haven''t had a chance to try it out yet, but when I do, I hope I can come up with something this nice!  Your lighting is perfect.  No hotspots, no shadows, just the right amount of subtle reflections.  I believe in the whole good vs evil in the world and I like the way you used frosted white chess pieces to represent ''all good people.''  The only things I can think of to improve would be to crop tighter on the right side to exclude the partial pawn.  I like the cropping on the left side pawn because it feels ''contained'' but there is too little of the pawn on the right  and it seems a little cut off.  I would also play around with the saturation of the yellows to reduce the yellowish brown thin band behind the pieces to the left at the edge of the board.  These two points are fairly minor (actually the yellowish band is pretty much nit-picking).  I like this image and give it a 9! Smellyfish1002', '2003-01-06 19:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(184258, 10641, 3080, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the song.  The blue shadows kind of bother me, but it doesn''t take away from the overall effect of the shot.  Your focus and clarity are ok.  The fuzzy parts of the coats seem a tad soft on the focus, not again, nothing serious.  Nice shot for the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good interpretation of the song.  The blue shadows kind of bother me, but it doesn''t take away from the overall effect of the shot.  Your focus and clarity are ok.  The fuzzy parts of the coats seem a tad soft on the focus, not again, nothing serious.  Nice shot for the challenge.  Good luck.', '2003-01-06 19:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(184263, 10604, 1647, '<td valign="top">How did you achieve this effect?  Is the shot taken through a warped piece of glass?</td>', 'How did you achieve this effect?  Is the shot taken through a warped piece of glass?', '2003-01-06 20:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
