(184662, 10476, 5070, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color to create atmosphere.</td>', 'Nice use of color to create atmosphere.', '2003-01-07 00:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(184663, 10588, 714, '<td valign="top">ARe these women boots?  Because a women sings this song and well they should be women boots.  I will trust that they are.  I think you could have added a little more contrast. Other wise good photo.</td>', 'ARe these women boots?  Because a women sings this song and well they should be women boots.  I will trust that they are.  I think you could have added a little more contrast. Other wise good photo.', '2003-01-07 00:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(184664, 10544, 2792, '<td valign="top">So that''s the stairway to heaven...I pictured it to be a little different.  =-)  Very nice photo!  I really like the colors; very earthy.  7</td>', 'So that''s the stairway to heaven...I pictured it to be a little different.  =-)  Very nice photo!  I really like the colors; very earthy.  7', '2003-01-07 00:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(184665, 10568, 5070, '<td valign="top">Is that a song? You should give the singer or composer too. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Is that a song? You should give the singer or composer too. Very nice photo.', '2003-01-07 00:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(184666, 10547, 714, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little off and the light is a bit bright.  Did you use your flash.  I have been taking picture with light from my window and am finding that it is too bright, maybe that is your problem.  Try adding some more contrast to it.  See how that works.</td>', 'The focus is a little off and the light is a bit bright.  Did you use your flash.  I have been taking picture with light from my window and am finding that it is too bright, maybe that is your problem.  Try adding some more contrast to it.  See how that works.', '2003-01-07 00:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(184667, 10462, 714, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  It didn''t even need the ship.  The sky is beautiful enough.</td>', 'Excellent!  It didn''t even need the ship.  The sky is beautiful enough.', '2003-01-07 00:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(184670, 10566, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that this is not a studio shot, good focus on the rose. I think the rose bud behind which is also in focus detracts from the focus of the rose. The rest of the plant is out of focus enough to not draw attention. 7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'I like the fact that this is not a studio shot, good focus on the rose. I think the rose bud behind which is also in focus detracts from the focus of the rose. The rest of the plant is out of focus enough to not draw attention. 7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 00:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(184671, 10661, 5964, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot for the for the stark contrast between the black and the flower. Beautiful job lighting the flower. It fits the song title well, Great job! 8.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'I really liked this shot for the for the stark contrast between the black and the flower. Beautiful job lighting the flower. It fits the song title well, Great job! 8. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 00:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
