(184699, 10480, 4049, '<td valign="top">Did you use one of those Nikon macro cool-lights for this?<br/>I''m not keen on the angle, the eye-lid distorts the view, the detail is good, but the light makes it look unnatural.</td>', 'Did you use one of those Nikon macro cool-lights for this?I''m not keen on the angle, the eye-lid distorts the view, the detail is good, but the light makes it look unnatural.', '2003-01-07 00:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
