(184711, 10432, 5964, '<td valign="top">Very creative, It made me whoop with laughter and the kids wondered why I was laughing so hard. I originally gave tis an seven for I really do not like the grey variant background due to your lighting. But it is suchh an original idea and so funny I bumped it up to a 8 when making comments.  Great job, keep those creative juices flowing.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo<br/></td>', 'Very creative, It made me whoop with laughter and the kids wondered why I was laughing so hard. I originally gave tis an seven for I really do not like the grey variant background due to your lighting. But it is suchh an original idea and so funny I bumped it up to a 8 when making comments.  Great job, keep those creative juices flowing. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 01:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
