(184716, 10684, 3936, '<td valign="top">I''d be interested in knowing how this one was done, at the end of the challenge.  Looks like IR but then IR usually doesn''t have these colors.  7</td>', 'I''d be interested in knowing how this one was done, at the end of the challenge.  Looks like IR but then IR usually doesn''t have these colors.  7', '2003-01-07 01:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
