(184732, 10668, 5964, '<td valign="top">I originally put this down for a 7, but after looking at it a while longer during the comments I changed to a six. The idea is great, but I really don''t like the effect of the mirror. The image became too busy. There is also the doubling effect of the image in the mirror possibly due tot he angle of light. Still great concept. 6.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'I originally put this down for a 7, but after looking at it a while longer during the comments I changed to a six. The idea is great, but I really don''t like the effect of the mirror. The image became too busy. There is also the doubling effect of the image in the mirror possibly due tot he angle of light. Still great concept. 6. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 01:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
