(184916, 10395, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like it: it''s not one of the usual cat-pictures because of the good cropping. Fits well to the title too.</td>', 'I like it: it''s not one of the usual cat-pictures because of the good cropping. Fits well to the title too.', '2003-01-07 11:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
