(184946, 10510, 3294, '<td valign="top">She''s hot!  hehe  But I think I would like to have seen more of the face... most of the details are lost in the shadows.</td>', 'She''s hot!  hehe  But I think I would like to have seen more of the face... most of the details are lost in the shadows.', '2003-01-07 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
