(184951, 10474, 3294, '<td valign="top">Neat effect... as if that second glass of wine is what you''ll feel like after drinking the wine!  Ha!  Well done.  But the peach color on the top and the curve on the right are distracting.</td>', 'Neat effect... as if that second glass of wine is what you''ll feel like after drinking the wine!  Ha!  Well done.  But the peach color on the top and the curve on the right are distracting.', '2003-01-07 11:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
