(184954, 10684, 3296, '<td valign="top">love the green and brown tones.</td>', 'love the green and brown tones.', '2003-01-07 11:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(184955, 10625, 5070, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t follow the lyrics exactly...but it is a good picture. Color of sky &amp; water is lovely.</td>', 'Doesn''t follow the lyrics exactly...but it is a good picture. Color of sky & water is lovely.', '2003-01-07 11:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(184956, 10683, 917, '<td valign="top">Most of your main subject is out of focus, get more light on it so that the camara uses a smaller aperture to increase the depth of field, or brace the camera to something and manually select a smaller aperture (= larger aperture number), most cameras are capable of f11, but generally default to f5 which is good for portraits/landscapes</td>', 'Most of your main subject is out of focus, get more light on it so that the camara uses a smaller aperture to increase the depth of field, or brace the camera to something and manually select a smaller aperture (= larger aperture number), most cameras are capable of f11, but generally default to f5 which is good for portraits/landscapes', '2003-01-07 11:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(184957, 10467, 5964, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! I really liked the idea of using the leaf as the background it gives a great contrast in color. Was all the rain the samw color or did the lighting make some look dark. The only prob I see is it is starting to lose focus ont he lower left hand part of the shot. The other corners do too a little which could be a nice effect but it would have to be evenly distributed.7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'Cool idea! I really liked the idea of using the leaf as the background it gives a great contrast in color. Was all the rain the samw color or did the lighting make some look dark. The only prob I see is it is starting to lose focus ont he lower left hand part of the shot. The other corners do too a little which could be a nice effect but it would have to be evenly distributed.7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 11:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(184958, 10480, 917, '<td valign="top">Is that a homegrown LED ring light?</td>', 'Is that a homegrown LED ring light?', '2003-01-07 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
