(184961, 10480, 3294, '<td valign="top">A little weird.  I''m trying to figure out what''s reflecting in that eye.</td>', 'A little weird.  I''m trying to figure out what''s reflecting in that eye.', '2003-01-07 12:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(184963, 10450, 5964, '<td valign="top">I really love this it was a great idea and exectuted fairly well. I would have given this shot a 10 if there was not the light washout withthe reflection on the top few inches of the shot. But still great job.7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'I really love this it was a great idea and exectuted fairly well. I would have given this shot a 10 if there was not the light washout withthe reflection on the top few inches of the shot. But still great job.7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 12:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
