(185016, 10490, 5070, '<td valign="top">Conveys the lyrics of the song well.</td>', 'Conveys the lyrics of the song well.', '2003-01-07 12:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(185017, 10535, 3080, '<td valign="top">Would have been a good travel photo too!  Focus and clarity are really good, lighting is good, angle and framing/cropping are also good.  Not really an overly exciting shot, but still very nicely executed.  I like the addition of the yellow lines, it saves the photo from lack of color.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Would have been a good travel photo too!  Focus and clarity are really good, lighting is good, angle and framing/cropping are also good.  Not really an overly exciting shot, but still very nicely executed.  I like the addition of the yellow lines, it saves the photo from lack of color.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-07 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(185022, 10476, 3080, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy for my personal taste.  However I like the motion blurr, and this definately represents the song nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  I like how you didnt just take a pic of the train directly from the side.  Seems to me like the powerline should have been in better focus, was this hand held?  I''d like to see some crisp focus on something in the photo.  The tones are nice for the shot.  I think that it gives it a dreamy kind of look.  Overall, a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A bit grainy for my personal taste.  However I like the motion blurr, and this definately represents the song nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  I like how you didnt just take a pic of the train directly from the side.  Seems to me like the powerline should have been in better focus, was this hand held?  I''d like to see some crisp focus on something in the photo.  The tones are nice for the shot.  I think that it gives it a dreamy kind of look.  Overall, a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-07 12:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(185024, 10360, 5677, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  I had to stare at it for a long time.  It''s powerful to me.</td>', 'I like this picture.  I had to stare at it for a long time.  It''s powerful to me.', '2003-01-07 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(185025, 10529, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone threw a glowstick in a dryer or something, and then sat ET in front of it.  I don''t know the song this is, and I have no clue what I''m looking at.  I''m kind of left in the dark on this shot.  I am just going to take your word that it''s a real song, but the photo doesn''t really appeal to me.  The color is good though.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like someone threw a glowstick in a dryer or something, and then sat ET in front of it.  I don''t know the song this is, and I have no clue what I''m looking at.  I''m kind of left in the dark on this shot.  I am just going to take your word that it''s a real song, but the photo doesn''t really appeal to me.  The color is good though.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-07 12:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(185029, 10667, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really cool, with the dark sky and the light sky.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok, I wonder what other kind of scenery you could have found though.  The horizon looks tilted, even though the tower is level.  I wish there were a little more to look at than just a sliver of the ground.  This would look cool framed with some tree leaves to one side or the other.  Excelent beautiful sky though.  Amazing color.  Great find.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really cool, with the dark sky and the light sky.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok, I wonder what other kind of scenery you could have found though.  The horizon looks tilted, even though the tower is level.  I wish there were a little more to look at than just a sliver of the ground.  This would look cool framed with some tree leaves to one side or the other.  Excelent beautiful sky though.  Amazing color.  Great find.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-07 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(185031, 10383, 3080, '<td valign="top">A swan in a cemetary??  Strange.  Not really getting the connection of the swan in a cemetary, to the song Yesterday, but I''ll take your word for it.  The lighting seems a tad harsh on the swans back. Focus seems ok though, and lighting on the rest of the shot is good.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok, maybe a slight right tilt, but it could just be on a hill.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A swan in a cemetary??  Strange.  Not really getting the connection of the swan in a cemetary, to the song Yesterday, but I''ll take your word for it.  The lighting seems a tad harsh on the swans back. Focus seems ok though, and lighting on the rest of the shot is good.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok, maybe a slight right tilt, but it could just be on a hill.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-07 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(185032, 10635, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice image...about the composition hmmmm... how about a some cropping, there''s a harsh shadow particularly in her nose , anyway you''ve got a better score from me.</td>', 'nice image...about the composition hmmmm... how about a some cropping, there''s a harsh shadow particularly in her nose , anyway you''ve got a better score from me.', '2003-01-07 12:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(185036, 10503, 4811, '<td valign="top">Exellent tonal range, an interesting and uncluttered background. Good focus. There is no mistake about the age of the boots, which is why the photo matches the song title well. Composition''s a little static, a straight-on shot, but overall a well executed capture.</td>', 'Exellent tonal range, an interesting and uncluttered background. Good focus. There is no mistake about the age of the boots, which is why the photo matches the song title well. Composition''s a little static, a straight-on shot, but overall a well executed capture.', '2003-01-07 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(185041, 10656, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I was tired of the tipical shot with a "great DOF" with the other flowers or plants outdoorish backgrounds. This choice of focus and DOF is very aesthetic, and the background color is excellent for this subject. I also like the shadow&amp;light detail from the blinds in the lower right corner.<br/> <br/>I would only leave the black line as frame, and get rid of the white frame; the flower could then have been a little closer to my eyes. The cropping is very consistent with your style, and it provides a clean and handsome composition.<br/> <br/>This has more of an afternoon feel, so it would rather be "there goes the sun" :)</td>', 'This is a great photo. I was tired of the tipical shot with a "great DOF" with the other flowers or plants outdoorish backgrounds. This choice of focus and DOF is very aesthetic, and the background color is excellent for this subject. I also like the shadow&light detail from the blinds in the lower right corner. I would only leave the black line as frame, and get rid of the white frame; the flower could then have been a little closer to my eyes. The cropping is very consistent with your style, and it provides a clean and handsome composition. This has more of an afternoon feel, so it would rather be "there goes the sun" :)', '2003-01-07 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(185044, 10644, 2361, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work.  9  Jak</td>', 'Beautiful work.  9  Jak', '2003-01-07 13:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(185057, 10450, 2858, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I think all these greys work well with the odd dash of red and yellow. Its abstract qualities make it one of the pictures of the week for me.</td>', 'Great composition. I think all these greys work well with the odd dash of red and yellow. Its abstract qualities make it one of the pictures of the week for me.', '2003-01-07 13:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(185061, 10631, 2858, '<td valign="top">I think this is very well composed and well balanced and would work equally well in many other colours. Does the oversaturation of blue bring the dark woodland forward? I just wonder whether it would have been possible to emphasise the space in this scene a bit more by adjusting the colour. Just a thought, but I really like it.</td>', 'I think this is very well composed and well balanced and would work equally well in many other colours. Does the oversaturation of blue bring the dark woodland forward? I just wonder whether it would have been possible to emphasise the space in this scene a bit more by adjusting the colour. Just a thought, but I really like it.', '2003-01-07 14:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(185064, 10444, 4811, '<td valign="top">Suffers from sharpness problems. Tone, contrast are very good, as well as cropping, de-emphasized background, composition and canine expression :)  However, it appeared to me only loosely fitting the song title, since its a domesticated animal, on a leash and in a setting that appear indoors, unless the meaning is the animal is born to be wild but cannot and never will live in a wild environment. Further proof interpretation is extremely subjective on the viewer :).</td>', 'Suffers from sharpness problems. Tone, contrast are very good, as well as cropping, de-emphasized background, composition and canine expression :)  However, it appeared to me only loosely fitting the song title, since its a domesticated animal, on a leash and in a setting that appear indoors, unless the meaning is the animal is born to be wild but cannot and never will live in a wild environment. Further proof interpretation is extremely subjective on the viewer :).', '2003-01-07 14:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(185065, 10527, 5899, '<td valign="top">Good God, the song isn''t called "The Ketchup Song", it''s called "Asereje"! <br/>Besides that, it''s a good picture...</td>', 'Good God, the song isn''t called "The Ketchup Song", it''s called "Asereje"! Besides that, it''s a good picture...', '2003-01-07 14:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
