(185085, 10674, 117, '<td valign="top">river is just a little dark</td>', 'river is just a little dark', '2003-01-07 14:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(185086, 10599, 3032, '<td valign="top">Ace, love the composition. The portrait of MM in the background makes this the best candle in the wind shot. I rate it high (yep vote high) on the composition alone. The candle in the foreground is a bit to soft, but that could well be an aperture decision to allow a fast enough shutter for the blown away flame. I like the lighting of the portrait. The frame is also in balance with the pic itself.<br/> <br/>Looking at MM herself, I like the left side of her face the most. :)</td>', 'Ace, love the composition. The portrait of MM in the background makes this the best candle in the wind shot. I rate it high (yep vote high) on the composition alone. The candle in the foreground is a bit to soft, but that could well be an aperture decision to allow a fast enough shutter for the blown away flame. I like the lighting of the portrait. The frame is also in balance with the pic itself. Looking at MM herself, I like the left side of her face the most. :)', '2003-01-07 14:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(185087, 10487, 6066, '<td valign="top">poor cropping.. the right side is unnecessary and detracting..</td>', 'poor cropping.. the right side is unnecessary and detracting..', '2003-01-07 14:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(185091, 10454, 5964, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scenery shot. I love the ice in the bush. I wish there was a bit more color and I wondered about the red in the pine trees to the left. Did the rising sun do that or was it an issue with the shot looks kind of strange. Good shot none the less.7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'What a beautiful scenery shot. I love the ice in the bush. I wish there was a bit more color and I wondered about the red in the pine trees to the left. Did the rising sun do that or was it an issue with the shot looks kind of strange. Good shot none the less.7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 14:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(185092, 10483, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think the composition might have looked better more centered within the frame, however the angle you have on the subject is good. I understand if lighting conditions prohibited centering. It looks like it might have been too dark on the left anyways. Less empty space on the top could have helped you too.</td>', 'I think the composition might have looked better more centered within the frame, however the angle you have on the subject is good. I understand if lighting conditions prohibited centering. It looks like it might have been too dark on the left anyways. Less empty space on the top could have helped you too.', '2003-01-07 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(185093, 10474, 3032, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, love both the patterns, nice subject.<br/>But is that the photographers nose we are looking into above the glass reflection??????? That is not so nice. :) I really looks like we are looking into a nose with a little moustache under it.<br/> <br/>Strange stuff in the fluid. Reflection on the glass -/- (but not in score).</td>', 'Strong composition, love both the patterns, nice subject.But is that the photographers nose we are looking into above the glass reflection??????? That is not so nice. :) I really looks like we are looking into a nose with a little moustache under it. Strange stuff in the fluid. Reflection on the glass -/- (but not in score).', '2003-01-07 14:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(185096, 10462, 4210, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.', '2003-01-07 14:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(185097, 10472, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting light study. Nice.</td>', 'Interesting light study. Nice.', '2003-01-07 14:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(185098, 10371, 5964, '<td valign="top">The picture is gorgeous but I just don''t think it fits the title too well. The focus is on the tree and not on the bridge and the water sure doesn''t look troubled it looks as serene as can be. But aside from that it is a neat shot.6.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'The picture is gorgeous but I just don''t think it fits the title too well. The focus is on the tree and not on the bridge and the water sure doesn''t look troubled it looks as serene as can be. But aside from that it is a neat shot.6. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 14:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(185099, 10502, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Would have tried to catch it a little earlier. The sun is a little overbearing, and the sunrise has a tendancy to create nice colours. Just a thought for later shots.</td>', 'Interesting. Would have tried to catch it a little earlier. The sun is a little overbearing, and the sunrise has a tendancy to create nice colours. Just a thought for later shots.', '2003-01-07 14:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(185101, 10366, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro!!<br/>Love the lighting and colors. Good choice of aperture, depth of focus from one side to the other. Nice composition, good crop, very good exposure, good detail.<br/></td>', 'Excellent macro!!Love the lighting and colors. Good choice of aperture, depth of focus from one side to the other. Nice composition, good crop, very good exposure, good detail.', '2003-01-07 15:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(185102, 10667, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot, for it truly looks like half is during the night while the lower is during the day. I wonder why you included the tower I would have cropped it out. It takes away from the focus of the sky and perhaps included a bit more land it almost looks as if the camera was tilted but i am sure this is not the case, it just gives that impression. Still good shot.7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'This is a neat shot, for it truly looks like half is during the night while the lower is during the day. I wonder why you included the tower I would have cropped it out. It takes away from the focus of the sky and perhaps included a bit more land it almost looks as if the camera was tilted but i am sure this is not the case, it just gives that impression. Still good shot.7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 15:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(185103, 10642, 3032, '<td valign="top">These kind of shots are very nice. It is a bit like Natasha''s portrayal of Mnt. Fuji. The strength of this shot is the layers of tones. From white to green in several steps. I really like this composition. Excellent picture!</td>', 'These kind of shots are very nice. It is a bit like Natasha''s portrayal of Mnt. Fuji. The strength of this shot is the layers of tones. From white to green in several steps. I really like this composition. Excellent picture!', '2003-01-07 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(185104, 10674, 5964, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot, I just wish the colors were not so dark.7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'I do like this shot, I just wish the colors were not so dark.7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 15:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(185105, 10696, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice flowing motion, and the glare on the branche is just enough to show the layer of ice. Blue is pretty dominant in this image, seems to create the right mood (cold).</td>', 'Nice flowing motion, and the glare on the branche is just enough to show the layer of ice. Blue is pretty dominant in this image, seems to create the right mood (cold).', '2003-01-07 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
