(185111, 10360, 6066, '<td valign="top">nice. excellent. lovely.</td>', 'nice. excellent. lovely.', '2003-01-07 15:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(185113, 10371, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice how the soft bridge-background creates a mood that seems to go with the song. The effect from the snow is great! <br/>There are a lot of jpeg compression artefacts around the branches and berries, could be avoided by saving at a higher quality level. There is room for that, the size is only 65kb (150kb max). It would look much better I think.<br/>Still worth an eight for the pic itself.</td>', 'Nice how the soft bridge-background creates a mood that seems to go with the song. The effect from the snow is great! There are a lot of jpeg compression artefacts around the branches and berries, could be avoided by saving at a higher quality level. There is room for that, the size is only 65kb (150kb max). It would look much better I think.Still worth an eight for the pic itself.', '2003-01-07 15:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(185114, 10595, 5964, '<td valign="top">WOW! I can''t imagine how you ever captured a flying bee like that. I liked the look of motion in the wings and the fact the back ground does not detract from the bee. I guess my only beef would be the light reflection given off in the abdomen, thorax and eyes and the far wing is not lit as well. But this is being picky. 7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'WOW! I can''t imagine how you ever captured a flying bee like that. I liked the look of motion in the wings and the fact the back ground does not detract from the bee. I guess my only beef would be the light reflection given off in the abdomen, thorax and eyes and the far wing is not lit as well. But this is being picky. 7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 15:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(185115, 10653, 6068, '<td valign="top">Awesome.. knew a slinky was good for something beyond entertaining kids for a few days after christmas..</td>', 'Awesome.. knew a slinky was good for something beyond entertaining kids for a few days after christmas..', '2003-01-07 15:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(185116, 10517, 5964, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, especially how the land in the background kind of melts away. I guess my only suggestion would be to play with the color a bit. I don''t think the body of the boat stands out enough from the water. The sail sure does. 8.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'I really like this shot, especially how the land in the background kind of melts away. I guess my only suggestion would be to play with the color a bit. I don''t think the body of the boat stands out enough from the water. The sail sure does. 8. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 15:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(185117, 10462, 3032, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful picture. You could argue that it is empty, but I think that is nonsense in this case. <br/>"Here comes the sun", well, it really shows that. The bright spot in the dramatic sky and the wonderful effect on the mist/haze is great. The sun also povides beatiful background detail without spoiling the image, the clouds over the mountains very nice.<br/>The boat is a nice touch, provides frontal horizon filling and above all a scale to aprreciate the ''greatness'' of the sun.<br/></td>', 'This is a very powerful picture. You could argue that it is empty, but I think that is nonsense in this case. "Here comes the sun", well, it really shows that. The bright spot in the dramatic sky and the wonderful effect on the mist/haze is great. The sun also povides beatiful background detail without spoiling the image, the clouds over the mountains very nice.The boat is a nice touch, provides frontal horizon filling and above all a scale to aprreciate the ''greatness'' of the sun.', '2003-01-07 15:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(185118, 10480, 5964, '<td valign="top">Great idea and I sure love the detail in eye, but the reflections from the macro light is sure distracting.6.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'Great idea and I sure love the detail in eye, but the reflections from the macro light is sure distracting.6. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(185119, 10518, 1005, '<td valign="top">Poor guy doesn''t seem to have much of an audiece.  Strong connection to the challenge.  Very good focus and detail.  Not certain what the man with the crutches is doing here, listening or passing through (can''t tell).  8 Swash<br/>(High WOW factor gets you the last two points.)</td>', 'Poor guy doesn''t seem to have much of an audiece.  Strong connection to the challenge.  Very good focus and detail.  Not certain what the man with the crutches is doing here, listening or passing through (can''t tell).  8 Swash(High WOW factor gets you the last two points.)', '2003-01-07 15:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(185122, 10592, 5964, '<td valign="top">Wow what a moving photo and it sure fits the title of the song. I am not one who really enjoys B&amp;W and in this case I don''t think it adds anything to the shot. It really doesn''t make the tombstone pop. I think I may have even done a tighter crop on the stone so as to not catch all the stones and crosses in the background. But overall good shot.7.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'Wow what a moving photo and it sure fits the title of the song. I am not one who really enjoys B&W and in this case I don''t think it adds anything to the shot. It really doesn''t make the tombstone pop. I think I may have even done a tighter crop on the stone so as to not catch all the stones and crosses in the background. But overall good shot.7. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-07 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
