(185490, 10558, 1647, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and framing.  I am left curious though about what is being reflected in the sunglasses.  I''m not sure if I''m meant to recognise it but my instinct is to try and recognise it?  Very good otherwise though - definitely suitable as an album cover.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and framing.  I am left curious though about what is being reflected in the sunglasses.  I''m not sure if I''m meant to recognise it but my instinct is to try and recognise it?  Very good otherwise though - definitely suitable as an album cover.', '2003-01-07 21:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
