(185496, 10631, 554, '<td valign="top">Absolutely.......I like it better when I crop a little of the foreground.     10</td>', 'Absolutely.......I like it better when I crop a little of the foreground.     10', '2003-01-07 21:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(185498, 10679, 1647, '<td valign="top">What a lovely moody photo.  Great work</td>', 'What a lovely moody photo.  Great work', '2003-01-07 22:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(185499, 10389, 554, '<td valign="top">good work</td>', 'good work', '2003-01-07 22:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(185501, 10635, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The soft focus works very nicely here.  I love the lighting, very angelic.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I think the use of black and white here.  Very very nice.  Background is also perfect.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The soft focus works very nicely here.  I love the lighting, very angelic.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I think the use of black and white here.  Very very nice.  Background is also perfect.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-07 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(185502, 10583, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  I wanted to try purple rain, but couldn''t get the look I wanted.  I like this very much.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  Focus is great.  The color is good, and lighting appears to be perfect for the shot.  Excelent job. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice effect.  I wanted to try purple rain, but couldn''t get the look I wanted.  I like this very much.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  Focus is great.  The color is good, and lighting appears to be perfect for the shot.  Excelent job. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-07 22:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(185504, 10366, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a very nice macro - great lighting, focus and depth of field.  Framing and background are also perfect.  Plus you have a great specimen/subject to work with.  Well done.</td>', 'That''s a very nice macro - great lighting, focus and depth of field.  Framing and background are also perfect.  Plus you have a great specimen/subject to work with.  Well done.', '2003-01-07 22:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(185505, 10432, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love your sense of humour.  Plus every time I hear that lyric I think of the karaoke song in Shrek.</td>', 'I love your sense of humour.  Plus every time I hear that lyric I think of the karaoke song in Shrek.', '2003-01-07 22:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(185506, 10486, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Where is this place?  It looks stunning.  Black and white really works well with such an old building and the lighting conditions you had.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow.  Where is this place?  It looks stunning.  Black and white really works well with such an old building and the lighting conditions you had.  Well done.', '2003-01-07 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(185512, 10683, 3419, '<td valign="top">This is a nice flower macro - composition-wise. However, the soft focus on the top petals on each flower is very distracting - would prefer crisp focus here.</td>', 'This is a nice flower macro - composition-wise. However, the soft focus on the top petals on each flower is very distracting - would prefer crisp focus here.', '2003-01-07 23:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(185513, 10450, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very in teresting photo. Wish I could identify exactly what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Very in teresting photo. Wish I could identify exactly what I''m looking at.', '2003-01-07 23:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(185514, 10465, 4648, '<td valign="top">Dislikes:  You cuat off the top of his/her head"his" for conversation ease).  Shame shame.  Likes:  everything, especially the two white hairs above his right eye.  I love the sheen to his fur.  Can''t decide how I feel about the shadow or darkness or his right side.  It makes his eye a little hard to really see but then it really doesn''t upset me that much since he is dark.  I like the B&amp;W.  I''ll give it a 7 PTL</td>', 'Dislikes:  You cuat off the top of his/her head"his" for conversation ease).  Shame shame.  Likes:  everything, especially the two white hairs above his right eye.  I love the sheen to his fur.  Can''t decide how I feel about the shadow or darkness or his right side.  It makes his eye a little hard to really see but then it really doesn''t upset me that much since he is dark.  I like the B&W.  I''ll give it a 7 PTL', '2003-01-07 23:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(185515, 10478, 4648, '<td valign="top">rather washed out.  White paper on off-white background?  Can''t tell if is out of focus or if appears this was because it is washed out.  Not too sure how they feel about this note here either.  I think they look down on it.  Photo wise though I can only give it a 4.  PTL</td>', 'rather washed out.  White paper on off-white background?  Can''t tell if is out of focus or if appears this was because it is washed out.  Not too sure how they feel about this note here either.  I think they look down on it.  Photo wise though I can only give it a 4.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(185516, 10504, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this the front of an album or something?  Personally it''s not appealing.  As a photo it''s well focused, nicely cropped.  Light is good, but a little bland.  I''ll give it a 5  PTL</td>', 'Is this the front of an album or something?  Personally it''s not appealing.  As a photo it''s well focused, nicely cropped.  Light is good, but a little bland.  I''ll give it a 5  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(185518, 10549, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know the darkness is intentional, but it''s too dark for me to tell much about it.  I''m sorry but what I can''t see I can''t score high.  So I''ll have to give it a 3.  PTL</td>', 'I know the darkness is intentional, but it''s too dark for me to tell much about it.  I''m sorry but what I can''t see I can''t score high.  So I''ll have to give it a 3.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(185520, 10447, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the song.  The photo appears to be a little out of focus overall or needs sharpened some.  I find myself straining my eyes to get a good look, and focus is only thing I can think of.  The kangaroo is posing for you at all.  You''d think he''d at least stand up for a photo.  It''s not a bad photo and might just be my eyes.  I''ll give it a 5.  PTL</td>', 'Love the song.  The photo appears to be a little out of focus overall or needs sharpened some.  I find myself straining my eyes to get a good look, and focus is only thing I can think of.  The kangaroo is posing for you at all.  You''d think he''d at least stand up for a photo.  It''s not a bad photo and might just be my eyes.  I''ll give it a 5.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(185523, 10594, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the photo.  It''s a beautiful photo with out it.  Without the photo, I live the focus, the shadows, the cropping the colors, the subject - a score of 7 or 8.  With the photo, it becomes a 4snapshot.  Without the photo it''s something I could see hanging on the wall of a livingroom.  Seriously.  PTL</td>', 'I don''t understand the photo.  It''s a beautiful photo with out it.  Without the photo, I live the focus, the shadows, the cropping the colors, the subject - a score of 7 or 8.  With the photo, it becomes a 4snapshot.  Without the photo it''s something I could see hanging on the wall of a livingroom.  Seriously.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(185525, 10454, 573, '<td valign="top">I see you have sacrificed any detail in the sun for detail in the landscape, which to me detracts from yout chosen topic.  Still one of my top ten this week</td>', 'I see you have sacrificed any detail in the sun for detail in the landscape, which to me detracts from yout chosen topic.  Still one of my top ten this week', '2003-01-07 23:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(185526, 10540, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t understand this.  Is this what parrots eat?  Good macro with nice dof.  I''ve never seen this at my Burger King.  What''s it called.  Having fun with you.  I''ll give it a 6.  PTL</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t understand this.  Is this what parrots eat?  Good macro with nice dof.  I''ve never seen this at my Burger King.  What''s it called.  Having fun with you.  I''ll give it a 6.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(185528, 10401, 573, '<td valign="top">Blonds I assume, but still the color is a bit washed out for my tastes.  Yet, one of my top ten this week.</td>', 'Blonds I assume, but still the color is a bit washed out for my tastes.  Yet, one of my top ten this week.', '2003-01-07 23:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(185529, 10366, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely the most beautiful shot of a rose that I have ever seen in my life, and that is no exageration.  This also is my favorite colored one.  Thank you for this photo.  There''s nothing to say except OMG!   You deserve this 10 and to be first.  It will be in my favorites.  PTL</td>', 'This is absolutely the most beautiful shot of a rose that I have ever seen in my life, and that is no exageration.  This also is my favorite colored one.  Thank you for this photo.  There''s nothing to say except OMG!   You deserve this 10 and to be first.  It will be in my favorites.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(185530, 10407, 573, '<td valign="top">Very descriptive photograph!!  If you shair I will give you a ten.  ;-)</td>', 'Very descriptive photograph!!  If you shair I will give you a ten.  ;-)', '2003-01-07 23:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(185531, 10678, 4648, '<td valign="top">This appears to be upside down.  Very awkward.  Should have cropped off the empty space, it adds nothing but emptiness.  These are beautiful roses - the  yellow rose means "the peace of God".  Cropped and turned upside down this is a 9.  As it is it''s a 5.  PTL  It''s just to akward to look at for me.</td>', 'This appears to be upside down.  Very awkward.  Should have cropped off the empty space, it adds nothing but emptiness.  These are beautiful roses - the  yellow rose means "the peace of God".  Cropped and turned upside down this is a 9.  As it is it''s a 5.  PTL  It''s just to akward to look at for me.', '2003-01-07 23:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(185533, 10506, 573, '<td valign="top">No comment neaded, just a well thought out and executed photograph.  Would I frame it and hang it on my wall?  No!  But I will give it a ten.</td>', 'No comment neaded, just a well thought out and executed photograph.  Would I frame it and hang it on my wall?  No!  But I will give it a ten.', '2003-01-07 23:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(185534, 10642, 573, '<td valign="top">Right on challenge and photograph, one of my top five.</td>', 'Right on challenge and photograph, one of my top five.', '2003-01-07 23:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(185535, 10502, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Is it really a sunrise or sunset.  They all look alike and there are so many of them this challenge.  And it does make a difference for the song title.  I know that is nitpicking.  I love the clouds, they look menancing.  This is an 8, if it is a sunrise.  PTL</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Is it really a sunrise or sunset.  They all look alike and there are so many of them this challenge.  And it does make a difference for the song title.  I know that is nitpicking.  I love the clouds, they look menancing.  This is an 8, if it is a sunrise.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(185536, 10635, 573, '<td valign="top">I am not familar with this song, but the photograph is one of my top five this week.</td>', 'I am not familar with this song, but the photograph is one of my top five this week.', '2003-01-07 23:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(185537, 10490, 4648, '<td valign="top">You get a 10 for creativity and composition, very unique and well thought out.  I like how Jackie is right against his shoulder and Marilyn is down and a few steps behind Jackie.  Speaks tons.  Very good composition with nice execution.  Good croping and focus.  Nice job.  Not "exciting" but really good shot.  7 PTL</td>', 'You get a 10 for creativity and composition, very unique and well thought out.  I like how Jackie is right against his shoulder and Marilyn is down and a few steps behind Jackie.  Speaks tons.  Very good composition with nice execution.  Good croping and focus.  Nice job.  Not "exciting" but really good shot.  7 PTL', '2003-01-07 23:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(185538, 10550, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is different, a little too dark, but nice.  Lighten it up and give it a little more contrast.  But good shot.  6 PTL</td>', 'This is different, a little too dark, but nice.  Lighten it up and give it a little more contrast.  But good shot.  6 PTL', '2003-01-07 23:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(185539, 10589, 4648, '<td valign="top">Leather.  Lace.  Rose?  The jacket fades into the black background.  Don''t know how you could avoid that in a B&amp;W without blowing out the white lace.  Rather tightly cropped.  Feels cramped and tight.  Nice focus.  6 PTL</td>', 'Leather.  Lace.  Rose?  The jacket fades into the black background.  Don''t know how you could avoid that in a B&W without blowing out the white lace.  Rather tightly cropped.  Feels cramped and tight.  Nice focus.  6 PTL', '2003-01-07 23:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(185540, 10502, 573, '<td valign="top">How do I know whis isn''t just a beautifull sunset.  Still one of my top five.</td>', 'How do I know whis isn''t just a beautifull sunset.  Still one of my top five.', '2003-01-07 23:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(185541, 10655, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice clear photo.  But this could have been taken anywhere.  There''s nothing in the photo to say it''s taken "under the bridge".  Maybe zoom out to show the bridge itself.  I do like the grafitti though.  As is it''s a 5.  PTL</td>', 'Good idea and nice clear photo.  But this could have been taken anywhere.  There''s nothing in the photo to say it''s taken "under the bridge".  Maybe zoom out to show the bridge itself.  I do like the grafitti though.  As is it''s a 5.  PTL', '2003-01-07 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
