(185778, 10500, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately yellow.  I couldn''t think of a better title.  Portrays the song nicely.  I like the matching colors, andhow the flowers are just a bit darker.  The angle and framing/cropping is good. I like how it''s at an angle and not dead center of the photo.  Good lighting, and the focus and clarity is very nice too. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately yellow.  I couldn''t think of a better title.  Portrays the song nicely.  I like the matching colors, andhow the flowers are just a bit darker.  The angle and framing/cropping is good. I like how it''s at an angle and not dead center of the photo.  Good lighting, and the focus and clarity is very nice too. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-08 12:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(185779, 10534, 3080, '<td valign="top">My parents got to see the BB when I was real little.  Dad caught a frisbee. Anyway, this is an excelent photo.  I''ve never even seen a real surf board, I don''t think.  The colors in this shot are simply beautiful.  The angle and framing/cropping is great as well.  Focus and clarity are just fine.  I can even see the little surfers out in the water.  The border works nicely as well.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'My parents got to see the BB when I was real little.  Dad caught a frisbee. Anyway, this is an excelent photo.  I''ve never even seen a real surf board, I don''t think.  The colors in this shot are simply beautiful.  The angle and framing/cropping is great as well.  Focus and clarity are just fine.  I can even see the little surfers out in the water.  The border works nicely as well.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-08 12:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(185781, 10649, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is an excelent photo.  The focus and clarity are great, and I like the soft smoke.  I guess I don''t understand the song reference, but I''ll take your word for it.  The color is very nice, and Angle and framing/cropping are great. I like how you have set the candle and holder to the left, with the smoke trailing off to the right.  Lighting works perfectly.  Border is good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an excelent photo.  The focus and clarity are great, and I like the soft smoke.  I guess I don''t understand the song reference, but I''ll take your word for it.  The color is very nice, and Angle and framing/cropping are great. I like how you have set the candle and holder to the left, with the smoke trailing off to the right.  Lighting works perfectly.  Border is good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-08 12:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(185784, 10666, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus and exposure are way off.  it''s just a shot of boobs.  Had this even remotely been in focus, I might have thought you took some time with the shot, however, I really don''t see any artistic value in this shot what so ever.  Sorry.</td>', 'Focus and exposure are way off.  it''s just a shot of boobs.  Had this even remotely been in focus, I might have thought you took some time with the shot, however, I really don''t see any artistic value in this shot what so ever.  Sorry.', '2003-01-08 12:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(185795, 10483, 3080, '<td valign="top">Never heard the song, but I''ll take your word for it.  The shot definately fits the title perfectly.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  I love the lower left placememnt of the wheel.  The sky is beautiful and I like how you have silhouetted everything.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Never heard the song, but I''ll take your word for it.  The shot definately fits the title perfectly.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  I love the lower left placememnt of the wheel.  The sky is beautiful and I like how you have silhouetted everything.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-08 12:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(185798, 10522, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice, a little tilted, but I don''t mind that in this photo at all.  The Lighting is just perfect.  Great focus and clarity.  Looks like a postcard.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty colors.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice, a little tilted, but I don''t mind that in this photo at all.  The Lighting is just perfect.  Great focus and clarity.  Looks like a postcard.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-08 12:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(185800, 10495, 3080, '<td valign="top">Why so dark?  I have never heard the song, however, if it has something to do with onions stuffed into a cymbol set, maybe i''m glad I''ve never heard it.  I wish there were a bit more lighting here.  Otherwise, the shot is ok, focus and clarity, angle and framing/cropping are all ok.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Why so dark?  I have never heard the song, however, if it has something to do with onions stuffed into a cymbol set, maybe i''m glad I''ve never heard it.  I wish there were a bit more lighting here.  Otherwise, the shot is ok, focus and clarity, angle and framing/cropping are all ok.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-08 12:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(185805, 10487, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think the white blobs are reflections on the glass.  They are a tad distracting.  So are the fingers.  To me, they are in such good focus, showing fingerprints and everything, that they hold my attention.  Very crisp focus on the fingerprints.  The time in a bottle is great.  I like the effect of the bottle on the watch.  A good interpretation of the challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think the white blobs are reflections on the glass.  They are a tad distracting.  So are the fingers.  To me, they are in such good focus, showing fingerprints and everything, that they hold my attention.  Very crisp focus on the fingerprints.  The time in a bottle is great.  I like the effect of the bottle on the watch.  A good interpretation of the challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-08 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
