(185980, 10609, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely the most georgeous eagle and greatest photo that I have ever seen.  This photo is deserving of honor and should be #1.  The neck feathers are so awesome, you can almost feel the texture.  The eye and the beak are.......It''s like looking at the live bird in person.  Wonderful photo and congratulations.  It can hang on my wall any day.  I''d love to give it a score of 100, but here''s a 10 since that''s all I''m allowed.  PTL</td>', 'This is absolutely the most georgeous eagle and greatest photo that I have ever seen.  This photo is deserving of honor and should be #1.  The neck feathers are so awesome, you can almost feel the texture.  The eye and the beak are.......It''s like looking at the live bird in person.  Wonderful photo and congratulations.  It can hang on my wall any day.  I''d love to give it a score of 100, but here''s a 10 since that''s all I''m allowed.  PTL', '2003-01-08 17:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
