(186144, 10498, 5351, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!  I just hope enough people voting know the songs lyrics well enough to know that it definately meets the challenge.  Great concept.  The only lthing I did find somewhat distracting (but probably only to me) is that not all of the back row pieces are showing, throwng off the symetry.  Very high score :)</td>', 'I really like this photo!  I just hope enough people voting know the songs lyrics well enough to know that it definately meets the challenge.  Great concept.  The only lthing I did find somewhat distracting (but probably only to me) is that not all of the back row pieces are showing, throwng off the symetry.  Very high score :)', '2003-01-08 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
