(186323, 10606, 917, '<td valign="top">This look too much like a snapshot. You need to get onto the same level as the subject (unless you have a specific reason for an unusual angle). The lighting on the subject is good, if a little cold. The railings in the background are annoying, I''d have tried to move the subject in front of something more interesting.</td>', 'This look too much like a snapshot. You need to get onto the same level as the subject (unless you have a specific reason for an unusual angle). The lighting on the subject is good, if a little cold. The railings in the background are annoying, I''d have tried to move the subject in front of something more interesting.', '2003-01-09 11:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
