(186328, 10343, 3447, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for a good sharp, well lighted photograph NOT done in a studio.</td>', 'Congratulations for a good sharp, well lighted photograph NOT done in a studio.', '2003-01-09 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(186330, 10671, 3447, '<td valign="top">Terrific angle and light. Well done.</td>', 'Terrific angle and light. Well done.', '2003-01-09 11:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(186332, 10547, 3936, '<td valign="top">This definetly catches the essence of the song.  I like the composition and the colors.  About the only drawbacks are the dark triangle at the lower right corner, and in the lower left there seems to be a bit of a shadow with the focus going a bit soft.  (Particularly the lower left of the 50 cent/pence? coin and the note behind it at the lower left corner.)  This is likely due to the angle of your camera.  The bottom of the frame is closer to the camera than the top, which makes it harder to fit it all within the depth of field.  Either less angle, a smaller (larger number) f stop, or fiddling with the manual focus, could help out.  <br/> <br/>Overall this is a very good picture and it gets an 8 from me.</td>', 'This definetly catches the essence of the song.  I like the composition and the colors.  About the only drawbacks are the dark triangle at the lower right corner, and in the lower left there seems to be a bit of a shadow with the focus going a bit soft.  (Particularly the lower left of the 50 cent/pence? coin and the note behind it at the lower left corner.)  This is likely due to the angle of your camera.  The bottom of the frame is closer to the camera than the top, which makes it harder to fit it all within the depth of field.  Either less angle, a smaller (larger number) f stop, or fiddling with the manual focus, could help out.   Overall this is a very good picture and it gets an 8 from me.', '2003-01-09 12:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(186334, 10389, 3936, '<td valign="top">Very good illustration of a song title.  Your manipulation of color, saturation, and contrast really make this picture pop.  The border is an excellent choice and adds, rather than competes/distracts/or merely decorates the picture.  <br/> <br/>If this one doesn''t win a ribbon, it darn well should.  10!</td>', 'Very good illustration of a song title.  Your manipulation of color, saturation, and contrast really make this picture pop.  The border is an excellent choice and adds, rather than competes/distracts/or merely decorates the picture.   If this one doesn''t win a ribbon, it darn well should.  10!', '2003-01-09 12:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(186336, 10573, 3936, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going here, but the sky came out blue.  So it looks more like just a wet street.  (More like After the Rain Has Gone.)  Focus is a bit soft for the majority of the frame.  The trees look very soft.  The structure to the right of the picture I would like to see more of, or less of.  I like the reflection of the the cars lights and other lighting in the water on the street. 5</td>', 'I see where you were going here, but the sky came out blue.  So it looks more like just a wet street.  (More like After the Rain Has Gone.)  Focus is a bit soft for the majority of the frame.  The trees look very soft.  The structure to the right of the picture I would like to see more of, or less of.  I like the reflection of the the cars lights and other lighting in the water on the street. 5', '2003-01-09 12:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
