(186465, 10678, 1379, '<td valign="top">Those look great!  I like that you chose to have them enter the frame from an unusual position.  This shot is really interesting and creative!</td>', 'Those look great!  I like that you chose to have them enter the frame from an unusual position.  This shot is really interesting and creative!', '2003-01-09 16:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(186466, 10464, 3751, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the arm on the picture thu I understand why it''s there.</td>', 'I don''t really like the arm on the picture thu I understand why it''s there.', '2003-01-09 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(186467, 10578, 1379, '<td valign="top">Nice action captured, but for me the tree in the bottom right really detracts from the overall image.  I would have liked a tighter crop, kind of visually releasing the bird from the limitations of the earth.</td>', 'Nice action captured, but for me the tree in the bottom right really detracts from the overall image.  I would have liked a tighter crop, kind of visually releasing the bird from the limitations of the earth.', '2003-01-09 16:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(186469, 10697, 1379, '<td valign="top">You all look so small and cute!  I love it!</td>', 'You all look so small and cute!  I love it!', '2003-01-09 16:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(186471, 10591, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome background for this song!  It''s interesting that your model seems complacent or somehow defeated, perhaps reflecting the mood of the song?</td>', 'Awesome background for this song!  It''s interesting that your model seems complacent or somehow defeated, perhaps reflecting the mood of the song?', '2003-01-09 16:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(186475, 10517, 1379, '<td valign="top">The water is so glittery.  Lovely.</td>', 'The water is so glittery.  Lovely.', '2003-01-09 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(186477, 10621, 1379, '<td valign="top">How sweet!  These children look so amused!</td>', 'How sweet!  These children look so amused!', '2003-01-09 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(186478, 10527, 1379, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the song, but the shot is interesting!  I like those two kids in the background, seeming sort of expectant.  Do they want their ketchup back?  :-)</td>', 'I don''t know the song, but the shot is interesting!  I like those two kids in the background, seeming sort of expectant.  Do they want their ketchup back?  :-)', '2003-01-09 16:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(186481, 10346, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  For me, your frame really enhances this already-beautiful shot.  Very lovely!</td>', 'Wow!  For me, your frame really enhances this already-beautiful shot.  Very lovely!', '2003-01-09 16:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(186483, 10576, 1379, '<td valign="top">Rustic!  I love the way the sky is so brooding, and it seems like it might be enough to topple this house.  I hope it withstood the rain!</td>', 'Rustic!  I love the way the sky is so brooding, and it seems like it might be enough to topple this house.  I hope it withstood the rain!', '2003-01-09 16:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(186484, 10618, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a sad commentary on the life of a busker!  This would make a great shot for a newspaper.  I also like the way the busker''s hand is blurred as he strums.  Very day-in-the-life.</td>', 'What a sad commentary on the life of a busker!  This would make a great shot for a newspaper.  I also like the way the busker''s hand is blurred as he strums.  Very day-in-the-life.', '2003-01-09 16:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(186485, 10695, 1379, '<td valign="top">Can''t say why exactly, but your photo brought tears to my eyes immediately.  I guess your title made me think of my own people, saved in snapshots like yours.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Can''t say why exactly, but your photo brought tears to my eyes immediately.  I guess your title made me think of my own people, saved in snapshots like yours.  Nice idea.', '2003-01-09 16:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(186487, 10485, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  I really like the way the candle holder catches the golden light from the flame.</td>', 'Great colors!  I really like the way the candle holder catches the golden light from the flame.', '2003-01-09 16:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(186488, 10634, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a shaggy tree!  The slice of moon is lovely and makes this photo elegant.</td>', 'What a shaggy tree!  The slice of moon is lovely and makes this photo elegant.', '2003-01-09 16:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(186491, 10601, 1379, '<td valign="top">The flowers and the view are lovely, but I wish your window weren''t so spotty.  Based on your altitude, maybe that was not your choice.</td>', 'The flowers and the view are lovely, but I wish your window weren''t so spotty.  Based on your altitude, maybe that was not your choice.', '2003-01-09 16:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(186492, 10586, 1379, '<td valign="top">Finally, a really good shot!  Well done!</td>', 'Finally, a really good shot!  Well done!', '2003-01-09 16:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(186493, 10505, 1379, '<td valign="top">She looks sleepy, too!</td>', 'She looks sleepy, too!', '2003-01-09 16:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(186498, 10546, 1379, '<td valign="top">Yargh, I am sad that you offered free publicity for this subtly racist song!  I know that now it''s part of our popular culture, but it''s offensive to Egyptians...  who walk just like everyone else.  Your photo is interesting in it''s own right, but I wish you had chosen "Walk This Way" or something else as your song.</td>', 'Yargh, I am sad that you offered free publicity for this subtly racist song!  I know that now it''s part of our popular culture, but it''s offensive to Egyptians...  who walk just like everyone else.  Your photo is interesting in it''s own right, but I wish you had chosen "Walk This Way" or something else as your song.', '2003-01-09 16:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(186499, 10508, 1379, '<td valign="top">Whoa, how much radiation did you get while taking this incredible photo?!    Your shot is absolutely hypnotizing.  Incredible.</td>', 'Whoa, how much radiation did you get while taking this incredible photo?!    Your shot is absolutely hypnotizing.  Incredible.', '2003-01-09 16:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(186500, 10619, 1379, '<td valign="top">I''m laughing!  I don''t know that this was your desired effect, but these people look so emotive and perhaps surprised that it makes me laugh!  I love this!</td>', 'I''m laughing!  I don''t know that this was your desired effect, but these people look so emotive and perhaps surprised that it makes me laugh!  I love this!', '2003-01-09 16:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(186506, 10656, 4380, '<td valign="top">crisp colour, like it so much.</td>', 'crisp colour, like it so much.', '2003-01-09 17:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(186507, 10571, 4380, '<td valign="top">good image</td>', 'good image', '2003-01-09 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(186514, 10684, 5857, '<td valign="top">WOW!  I dont know what it is about this pic, but it is incredible.</td>', 'WOW!  I dont know what it is about this pic, but it is incredible.', '2003-01-09 17:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(186521, 10522, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well I LIKE the angle of the sign but NOT the angle of the Tour Eiffel - and the green of the sign is kind of odd... I mostly like it OK but that sign thingy at the bottom makes it less appealing to me - I think it''s the base of the balloon maybe...</td>', 'Well I LIKE the angle of the sign but NOT the angle of the Tour Eiffel - and the green of the sign is kind of odd... I mostly like it OK but that sign thingy at the bottom makes it less appealing to me - I think it''s the base of the balloon maybe...', '2003-01-09 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(186531, 10594, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Interesting shadows.  Who is the boy in the photo and why is it sideways?  Mostly, I see shrubbery parts that are used in flower arrangements, and a few dried flowers in front of the photo.  I think I see the point you were going for, but I think I would have liked the flowers to be prominent.  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo.  Interesting shadows.  Who is the boy in the photo and why is it sideways?  Mostly, I see shrubbery parts that are used in flower arrangements, and a few dried flowers in front of the photo.  I think I see the point you were going for, but I think I would have liked the flowers to be prominent.  6 Swash', '2003-01-09 18:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(186533, 10344, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, but IMHO, overly manipulated color.  Cute title, but prolly not well accepted.  Challenge met.  Sorry 5, Swash</td>', 'This is interesting, but IMHO, overly manipulated color.  Cute title, but prolly not well accepted.  Challenge met.  Sorry 5, Swash', '2003-01-09 18:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(186534, 10370, 1005, '<td valign="top">A little overly manipulated for a photo challenge.  It''s an interesting look, but feels more like a painting than a photo.  Challenge met.  5 Swash</td>', 'A little overly manipulated for a photo challenge.  It''s an interesting look, but feels more like a painting than a photo.  Challenge met.  5 Swash', '2003-01-09 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(186536, 10504, 1005, '<td valign="top">A little dark, otherwise, you have captured this person''s art very nicely.  ER is one of my favorite Beatles tunes.  5 Swash</td>', 'A little dark, otherwise, you have captured this person''s art very nicely.  ER is one of my favorite Beatles tunes.  5 Swash', '2003-01-09 18:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(186537, 10492, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat, but dim photo.  (What is it?)  Sorry, I don''t recall the song, but I''ll take your word for it.  Lots of negative space.  (Wish I could make out what this is....I think it might be really, really cool.) 5 Swash</td>', 'Neat, but dim photo.  (What is it?)  Sorry, I don''t recall the song, but I''ll take your word for it.  Lots of negative space.  (Wish I could make out what this is....I think it might be really, really cool.) 5 Swash', '2003-01-09 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(186541, 10565, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is this really a picture of Jupiter?  I have no problem with the grain, if this really is Jupiter, it would be hard to not have grain.  If this is faked, the grain helps hide the faki-ness.  Somehow it seems too patterned (stripes).  5 Swash</td>', 'Is this really a picture of Jupiter?  I have no problem with the grain, if this really is Jupiter, it would be hard to not have grain.  If this is faked, the grain helps hide the faki-ness.  Somehow it seems too patterned (stripes).  5 Swash', '2003-01-09 18:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(186548, 10626, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I''ve never heard of this song.  Who did it?  Photo is very clear, but on the low interest side.  5 Swash</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I''ve never heard of this song.  Who did it?  Photo is very clear, but on the low interest side.  5 Swash', '2003-01-09 18:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(186549, 10525, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat sillhouette, but I would have preferred either seeing some facial features or pure sillhouette.  This leaves wanting to see more of her.  I do like the pose.  Very cool.  It might have been cool from behind, too, showing the sheet music and her hands.  5 Swash</td>', 'Neat sillhouette, but I would have preferred either seeing some facial features or pure sillhouette.  This leaves wanting to see more of her.  I do like the pose.  Very cool.  It might have been cool from behind, too, showing the sheet music and her hands.  5 Swash', '2003-01-09 18:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(186550, 10635, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great photo - It looks very much like a potential album cover (which I consider appropriate for this challenge).  Great lighting and composition.  Great subject and great atmosphere / mood.  Out of curiousity, what did it look like in colour?</td>', 'Great photo - It looks very much like a potential album cover (which I consider appropriate for this challenge).  Great lighting and composition.  Great subject and great atmosphere / mood.  Out of curiousity, what did it look like in colour?', '2003-01-09 18:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(186553, 10510, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny shot.  I''m guessing, it''s a him gorilla and not a her monkey.  I think I might have bought into this more with the song "Hey Hey, We''re The Monkeys" instead.  Lighting isn''t optimal for a great shot (dark face against light background).    Good detail on the top of head hair.  6 Swash</td>', 'Funny shot.  I''m guessing, it''s a him gorilla and not a her monkey.  I think I might have bought into this more with the song "Hey Hey, We''re The Monkeys" instead.  Lighting isn''t optimal for a great shot (dark face against light background).    Good detail on the top of head hair.  6 Swash', '2003-01-09 19:00:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(186554, 10472, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo the more I look at it.  It has a simple stark quality that works really well.  It fits the song title very well, yet is interesting within itself (several other photos match the song title but aren''t good photo''s on their own this week).  Well done.</td>', 'I really like this photo the more I look at it.  It has a simple stark quality that works really well.  It fits the song title very well, yet is interesting within itself (several other photos match the song title but aren''t good photo''s on their own this week).  Well done.', '2003-01-09 19:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(186555, 10604, 1005, '<td valign="top">Appropriately trippy.  Nice surreal piece.  The bubble in the glass below the ears, ouch (at least, that''s what it looks like).  Funny shot.  Challenge met.  This one grows on a person.  Initially scored as a 6, upgraded to 7.  Swash</td>', 'Appropriately trippy.  Nice surreal piece.  The bubble in the glass below the ears, ouch (at least, that''s what it looks like).  Funny shot.  Challenge met.  This one grows on a person.  Initially scored as a 6, upgraded to 7.  Swash', '2003-01-09 19:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(186557, 10377, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice dog photo, but it''s a stretch, many dogs look sad, even when they are happy.  I don''t recognize the song, but don''t fear, I''m not penalizing you on my lack of song titles.  Challenge met, but on the weak side.  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice dog photo, but it''s a stretch, many dogs look sad, even when they are happy.  I don''t recognize the song, but don''t fear, I''m not penalizing you on my lack of song titles.  Challenge met, but on the weak side.  6 Swash', '2003-01-09 19:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(186558, 10508, 1647, '<td valign="top">You''ve done very well to make an interesting photograph out of something I would have really struggled with (I don''t think outside the square very well normally).  Good work.</td>', 'You''ve done very well to make an interesting photograph out of something I would have really struggled with (I don''t think outside the square very well normally).  Good work.', '2003-01-09 19:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(186559, 10597, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good pic of the house, but with no frame of reference, I''ll just take your word that it''s in Alabama, O.K?  Great colors (sky not withstanding, can''t control that, can you?)  Focus is very good.  Framing works well enough.   (Shoe dropping) Interest level on the lower side(but I love that song!).  6 Swash</td>', 'Good pic of the house, but with no frame of reference, I''ll just take your word that it''s in Alabama, O.K?  Great colors (sky not withstanding, can''t control that, can you?)  Focus is very good.  Framing works well enough.   (Shoe dropping) Interest level on the lower side(but I love that song!).  6 Swash', '2003-01-09 19:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(186561, 10395, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good cat portrait.  Challenge well met.  Good color.  Close framing, but it works.  Great details.  Score upgrade from 6 to 8 (huge jump for me).  Swash</td>', 'Very good cat portrait.  Challenge well met.  Good color.  Close framing, but it works.  Great details.  Score upgrade from 6 to 8 (huge jump for me).  Swash', '2003-01-09 19:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(186562, 10372, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is actually quite appropriate to what I remember of IceHouse.  If they had an album cover like this I wouldn''t have been surprised.  Well done - and thanks for explaining what it was.</td>', 'This is actually quite appropriate to what I remember of IceHouse.  If they had an album cover like this I wouldn''t have been surprised.  Well done - and thanks for explaining what it was.', '2003-01-09 19:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
