(186940, 10621, 3936, '<td valign="top">I really wish I could speak/read Spanish here.  An english translation would have really helped.  My guess, from what little (and I mean very little) Spanish I know, is that this translates roughly as.. (I hope) In the (sea?) (life?) is more (delicious? flavorful?  tasty?)  This picture certainly seems to communicate that.  The biggest thing I see is that fill flash, or more fill flash, or reflector would have been helpful here.  As it is the girls faces are in shadow and it takes a bit away from the bright surroundings.  7</td>', 'I really wish I could speak/read Spanish here.  An english translation would have really helped.  My guess, from what little (and I mean very little) Spanish I know, is that this translates roughly as.. (I hope) In the (sea?) (life?) is more (delicious? flavorful?  tasty?)  This picture certainly seems to communicate that.  The biggest thing I see is that fill flash, or more fill flash, or reflector would have been helpful here.  As it is the girls faces are in shadow and it takes a bit away from the bright surroundings.  7', '2003-01-10 14:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(186942, 10549, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with your song title, but I''ll take your word for it. Interesting shot, but IMO it''s a little dark.  Is the song really a dark one?  What are these, lookouts?<br/>6 Swash</td>', 'I''m not familiar with your song title, but I''ll take your word for it. Interesting shot, but IMO it''s a little dark.  Is the song really a dark one?  What are these, lookouts?6 Swash', '2003-01-10 14:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(186944, 10534, 3936, '<td valign="top">The surfer is almost lost in the shadows of the pier.  Wish you had caught him/her when (s)he was lined up with the bright part of the reflection of the sun.  The sky around the sun is burnt out a bit, but not a fatal problem.  I like the colors of the sky and they way they are mirrored on the beach and are cast over the water.  7</td>', 'The surfer is almost lost in the shadows of the pier.  Wish you had caught him/her when (s)he was lined up with the bright part of the reflection of the sun.  The sky around the sun is burnt out a bit, but not a fatal problem.  I like the colors of the sky and they way they are mirrored on the beach and are cast over the water.  7', '2003-01-10 14:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(186946, 10495, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot!  Very different!  (Thanks for the band reference in the title, sorry, but I still don''t recognize either, but it helps!)  Photo is a tad dark for my tastes, is the song dark, too?  (looking for a correlation)  Fairly sharp, but I''d like more detail in the onion''s roots.  6 Swash</td>', 'Interesting shot!  Very different!  (Thanks for the band reference in the title, sorry, but I still don''t recognize either, but it helps!)  Photo is a tad dark for my tastes, is the song dark, too?  (looking for a correlation)  Fairly sharp, but I''d like more detail in the onion''s roots.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(186950, 10469, 811, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that I didn''t particularly care for one the first go ''round, but on subsequent looks, I like the texture, color, and lighting.  Very nicely done abstract, I think.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that I didn''t particularly care for one the first go ''round, but on subsequent looks, I like the texture, color, and lighting.  Very nicely done abstract, I think.', '2003-01-10 14:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(186951, 10418, 811, '<td valign="top">The simple composition and bright colors make this an awesome shot.  I also like the strong pattern of the vertical lines.</td>', 'The simple composition and bright colors make this an awesome shot.  I also like the strong pattern of the vertical lines.', '2003-01-10 14:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(186952, 10370, 811, '<td valign="top">Typically, I do not like shots that look to have been post processed this heavily. BUT, this one struck me differently.  I like the composition and the stark colors.  Would make a good cover for the album, I think</td>', 'Typically, I do not like shots that look to have been post processed this heavily. BUT, this one struck me differently.  I like the composition and the stark colors.  Would make a good cover for the album, I think', '2003-01-10 14:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(186955, 10692, 3936, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of potential here.  However, the rug at the upper right distracts and competes for attention due to the brightness of the rug, and the lower light levels on the child''s face and body.  Fill flash would have helped.  The dark object at left intrudes into the picture and either needs to gone (best) or more a part (if needed because the child doesn''t yet walk).  The crop is very tight.  The tip of the head is cut off, and the feet and leaf are in danger of dissapearing.  The window at left also is an intrusion because of the brightness and angles.  However the leaf, the general body language and especially the expression of the child, are priceless.  In a different setting (which would be easiest) this could easily become a 10.  As is, I''m voting an 8 on this one.</td>', 'There is a lot of potential here.  However, the rug at the upper right distracts and competes for attention due to the brightness of the rug, and the lower light levels on the child''s face and body.  Fill flash would have helped.  The dark object at left intrudes into the picture and either needs to gone (best) or more a part (if needed because the child doesn''t yet walk).  The crop is very tight.  The tip of the head is cut off, and the feet and leaf are in danger of dissapearing.  The window at left also is an intrusion because of the brightness and angles.  However the leaf, the general body language and especially the expression of the child, are priceless.  In a different setting (which would be easiest) this could easily become a 10.  As is, I''m voting an 8 on this one.', '2003-01-10 14:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(186956, 10534, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors.  My only nit, and I understand you probably couldn''t control it is the location of the surfer.  If he/she had been on the right, you would have one "kick butt" shot here.  As it is, it taps butt really hard.  Score bump to 10.</td>', 'Awesome colors.  My only nit, and I understand you probably couldn''t control it is the location of the surfer.  If he/she had been on the right, you would have one "kick butt" shot here.  As it is, it taps butt really hard.  Score bump to 10.', '2003-01-10 14:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(186963, 10501, 1005, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t recall you song, but I like this look.  Very blue, maybe a little too manipulated blue, but still nice.  6 Swash</td>', 'I honestly don''t recall you song, but I like this look.  Very blue, maybe a little too manipulated blue, but still nice.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 15:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(186964, 10415, 6121, '<td valign="top">Fantastic</td>', 'Fantastic', '2003-01-10 15:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(186965, 10571, 1005, '<td valign="top">I think you conveyed the idea of the song well, but the overall lack of color, to me, weakens the shot.  (I like bright, colorful shots)  6 Swash</td>', 'I think you conveyed the idea of the song well, but the overall lack of color, to me, weakens the shot.  (I like bright, colorful shots)  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 15:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(186967, 10405, 1005, '<td valign="top">I just realized, that a face in the background?  (yes, it is!)  Interesting shot, but I''m not overly fond of the coloration, even though necessary for the song connection. 6 Swash</td>', 'I just realized, that a face in the background?  (yes, it is!)  Interesting shot, but I''m not overly fond of the coloration, even though necessary for the song connection. 6 Swash', '2003-01-10 15:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(186968, 10681, 1005, '<td valign="top">(Kinda distance smoke....)  Nice photo, but w/o the title, I would have never guessed where you were going with this.  6 Swash</td>', '(Kinda distance smoke....)  Nice photo, but w/o the title, I would have never guessed where you were going with this.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 15:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(186969, 10618, 6121, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2003-01-10 15:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(186970, 10346, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot.  The contrast between the sunrise and the land is, well, maybe too sharp.  I just don''t seem to like the lights on the far shoreline.  6 Swash</td>', 'Pretty shot.  The contrast between the sunrise and the land is, well, maybe too sharp.  I just don''t seem to like the lights on the far shoreline.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 15:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(186971, 10595, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture!  Extremely difficult shot!  (I know!!!)  I think it would have been slightly cooler with a faster exposure, to make the wings more solid, but those wings move pretty fast, this could have been pretty fast anyway.  Score bump from 8 to 9.  Swash</td>', 'Wow, great capture!  Extremely difficult shot!  (I know!!!)  I think it would have been slightly cooler with a faster exposure, to make the wings more solid, but those wings move pretty fast, this could have been pretty fast anyway.  Score bump from 8 to 9.  Swash', '2003-01-10 15:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(186972, 10546, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot (of someone else''s art, I have a slight problem with that).  The walls/beams/columns on either side seem sort of distracting.  Very strong contrast (I like that!)  6 Swash</td>', 'Cool shot (of someone else''s art, I have a slight problem with that).  The walls/beams/columns on either side seem sort of distracting.  Very strong contrast (I like that!)  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 15:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(186973, 10452, 1005, '<td valign="top">A classic!  Very well done!!  Challenge well met.  8 Swash</td>', 'A classic!  Very well done!!  Challenge well met.  8 Swash', '2003-01-10 15:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(186986, 10478, 1005, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overly pale, even the pen.  (Did you lighten the brightness?)  Maybe try re-saturating the color afterwards (If  this is what you did)  6 Swash</td>', 'Seems a little overly pale, even the pen.  (Did you lighten the brightness?)  Maybe try re-saturating the color afterwards (If  this is what you did)  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(186987, 10472, 1005, '<td valign="top">Classic Bruce song!  I really like the sun-ray effect, well executed.  The glare on the top of the head is maybe a little too strong, but prolly couldn''t be helped, no score change.  In fact, this is growning on me.  Score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Swash</td>', 'Classic Bruce song!  I really like the sun-ray effect, well executed.  The glare on the top of the head is maybe a little too strong, but prolly couldn''t be helped, no score change.  In fact, this is growning on me.  Score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Swash', '2003-01-10 16:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(186989, 10479, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, tomatilla, right?  Seems small compared to the other pictures.  No distracting background, but it makes it so very stark, lonely.  I can''t remember the song, but isn''t it on the sad, lonely side, too? (if so, very good thing).  Still, I get very little emotional connection to this pic.  6 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot, tomatilla, right?  Seems small compared to the other pictures.  No distracting background, but it makes it so very stark, lonely.  I can''t remember the song, but isn''t it on the sad, lonely side, too? (if so, very good thing).  Still, I get very little emotional connection to this pic.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(186991, 10363, 1005, '<td valign="top">I think I remember this song title, I''ll buy it.  Very nice, simple shot.  I don''t get a sense of drama that I would like to have.  Lots of negative space.  The viewer''s attention is solidly on the flame.  6 Swash</td>', 'I think I remember this song title, I''ll buy it.  Very nice, simple shot.  I don''t get a sense of drama that I would like to have.  Lots of negative space.  The viewer''s attention is solidly on the flame.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(186993, 10485, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken, good framing, technically really nice.  Challenge well met.  It seems a little too stark, no suggestions, sorry.  6 Swash</td>', 'Well taken, good framing, technically really nice.  Challenge well met.  It seems a little too stark, no suggestions, sorry.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 16:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(186995, 10443, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken shot!  John, your level of detail is amazing.  Great choice of songs!  (I''m a little foggy about the satin part, would the finish on the chess pieces be called "satin"? It''s O.K. really, just asking)  Challenge well met.  Neat reflections on the chess board.  Score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Swash</td>', 'Very well taken shot!  John, your level of detail is amazing.  Great choice of songs!  (I''m a little foggy about the satin part, would the finish on the chess pieces be called "satin"? It''s O.K. really, just asking)  Challenge well met.  Neat reflections on the chess board.  Score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Swash', '2003-01-10 16:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(186997, 10659, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat picture, but I''m seeing alot of white dots...is that part of things that are producing the flames?  (I think yes, but would like to know)  Flame glows nicely.  Challenge met.  6 Swash</td>', 'Neat picture, but I''m seeing alot of white dots...is that part of things that are producing the flames?  (I think yes, but would like to know)  Flame glows nicely.  Challenge met.  6 Swash', '2003-01-10 16:32:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(187001, 10684, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, those are funky colours.  I like it.</td>', 'Wow, those are funky colours.  I like it.', '2003-01-10 16:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(187002, 10372, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation.</td>', 'Good interpretation.', '2003-01-10 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(187003, 10622, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I just find the boxing glove a bit tacky (not for the picture, but the way the glove is constructed; looks like silk or something).  Nice freeze.  Jacko. 8</td>', 'Great idea.  I just find the boxing glove a bit tacky (not for the picture, but the way the glove is constructed; looks like silk or something).  Nice freeze.  Jacko. 8', '2003-01-10 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(187005, 10582, 2716, '<td valign="top">Sweet stuff.  I''ll give you a 6 because I like the knife.</td>', 'Sweet stuff.  I''ll give you a 6 because I like the knife.', '2003-01-10 16:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(187007, 10611, 2716, '<td valign="top">The angle seems odd somehow.  I think I''d like to see it dead on.  Nice tones.  Jacko 7</td>', 'The angle seems odd somehow.  I think I''d like to see it dead on.  Nice tones.  Jacko 7', '2003-01-10 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(187008, 10569, 2716, '<td valign="top">What on earth is that.  Looks like a AIDS virus.  I like the contrast green/pink.</td>', 'What on earth is that.  Looks like a AIDS virus.  I like the contrast green/pink.', '2003-01-10 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(187010, 10544, 2716, '<td valign="top">Led Zep.  I see the stairway, but I''m not sure where the heaven reference comes from (Is that an old temple).    I find the picture too dark (not in exposure, but the overall colours).  Jacko.</td>', 'Led Zep.  I see the stairway, but I''m not sure where the heaven reference comes from (Is that an old temple).    I find the picture too dark (not in exposure, but the overall colours).  Jacko.', '2003-01-10 16:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(187011, 10398, 2716, '<td valign="top">I guess I just don''t like figurines.  I''d like to see more of th  text (blocked by the wings).  Jacko</td>', 'I guess I just don''t like figurines.  I''d like to see more of th  text (blocked by the wings).  Jacko', '2003-01-10 16:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(187012, 10566, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro.  I like the depth of field on this one.  Great shot, though the rose bud is a bit distracting.  Good job.  Jacko  8</td>', 'Nice Macro.  I like the depth of field on this one.  Great shot, though the rose bud is a bit distracting.  Good job.  Jacko  8', '2003-01-10 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(187013, 10354, 2716, '<td valign="top">I''d like to have that lens.  Nice shot.  I really like the sharpness and the colour of the sky.  Good luck.  Jacko  9</td>', 'I''d like to have that lens.  Nice shot.  I really like the sharpness and the colour of the sky.  Good luck.  Jacko  9', '2003-01-10 16:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(187014, 10377, 2716, '<td valign="top">Whey the Black and white? The Christmas tree is hidden by the lack of colour.  Cute dog.</td>', 'Whey the Black and white? The Christmas tree is hidden by the lack of colour.  Cute dog.', '2003-01-10 16:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(187016, 10559, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I like the starburst, however it feels a bit too intense (th esun).  I still like the feeliing of the photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great capture.  I like the starburst, however it feels a bit too intense (th esun).  I still like the feeliing of the photo.  Good luck.', '2003-01-10 16:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(187021, 10389, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love these kind of shots.  Can\''t say I recognize the song.  Super composition.  I\''ll give you a 10 because it\''s exactly the kind of photogrpahy I like to do.  10  Keep up the good  work.    (PS my only 10 so far)</td>', 'I love these kind of shots.  Can\''t say I recognize the song.  Super composition.  I\''ll give you a 10 because it\''s exactly the kind of photogrpahy I like to do.  10  Keep up the good  work.    (PS my only 10 so far)', '2003-01-10 17:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(187032, 10398, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo (sorry, but I feel this is mostly somebody else''s art, but you have added some to it, so I won''t be too hard on you)  Glass statue seems slightly out of focus.  6 Swash<br/>Very touching, sorry, but I missed the photo in the mirror.  I should have seen it.  My bad.  Score upgrade to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Nice photo (sorry, but I feel this is mostly somebody else''s art, but you have added some to it, so I won''t be too hard on you)  Glass statue seems slightly out of focus.  6 SwashVery touching, sorry, but I missed the photo in the mirror.  I should have seen it.  My bad.  Score upgrade to 8.  Swash', '2003-01-10 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(187036, 10517, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice sailing shot, good use of the 1/3 rule.  Very clear.  I like the heat waves coming off the water in the distance.  (Your frame is a little too close the the water color for my tastes).  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice sailing shot, good use of the 1/3 rule.  Very clear.  I like the heat waves coming off the water in the distance.  (Your frame is a little too close the the water color for my tastes).  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 17:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(187044, 10642, 1005, '<td valign="top">(Tease - Isn''t that Foggy?)  Neat picture, great mystery in fog.  Are you getting nasty comments about your frame?  I like it, but maybe a little too dark.  (No score effect either way!)  7 Swash</td>', '(Tease - Isn''t that Foggy?)  Neat picture, great mystery in fog.  Are you getting nasty comments about your frame?  I like it, but maybe a little too dark.  (No score effect either way!)  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 17:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(187046, 10389, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is that a show tune?  Seem familiar, but I can''t place it.  Very good color!  Very sharp!  (Total NIT:  somehow the single safety pin seems out of place, no score change for it)  Interesting and nice to look at.  7 Swash  (neat reflections, too)</td>', 'Is that a show tune?  Seem familiar, but I can''t place it.  Very good color!  Very sharp!  (Total NIT:  somehow the single safety pin seems out of place, no score change for it)  Interesting and nice to look at.  7 Swash  (neat reflections, too)', '2003-01-10 17:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(187047, 10564, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  Is this a baby?  Something about the back of his head bothers me, but I can''t describe what.  Neat reflections.  Challenge met.  7 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot!  Is this a baby?  Something about the back of his head bothers me, but I can''t describe what.  Neat reflections.  Challenge met.  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 17:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(187050, 10503, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yup!  Very sharp photo.  Since the boots are dirty/messy, I would think the background would need to be more solid (or vice versa).  Challenge met.  Seems to need stronger contrast.  7 Swash</td>', 'Yup!  Very sharp photo.  Since the boots are dirty/messy, I would think the background would need to be more solid (or vice versa).  Challenge met.  Seems to need stronger contrast.  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 17:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(187053, 10621, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute photo!  Very good expressions.  Sorry, I can''t read spanish, but I''ll take your word for that it meets the challenge, O.K?  I think I would have liked to see the sun fall just a little more on their faces, but otherwise a really nice shot.  (It turned out well anyway!)  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute photo!  Very good expressions.  Sorry, I can''t read spanish, but I''ll take your word for that it meets the challenge, O.K?  I think I would have liked to see the sun fall just a little more on their faces, but otherwise a really nice shot.  (It turned out well anyway!)  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 17:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(187055, 10677, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, kinda interesting wall, but the song is sooo much more than stones.  To me, this needs something more, an angry, bitter Mom or a little scared child, something along that line to complete the connection to the song.  Sorry, but I don''t care for the background.  I''m sure you couldn''t do much with that, but it distracts without adding value.  I do sort of like the vine creaping up the wall, even though it has nothing to do with the song, well maybe......  <br/>Sorry, but upon further review, I''m dropping the score slightly on this one.  From 7 to 6.   Swash</td>', 'Nice, kinda interesting wall, but the song is sooo much more than stones.  To me, this needs something more, an angry, bitter Mom or a little scared child, something along that line to complete the connection to the song.  Sorry, but I don''t care for the background.  I''m sure you couldn''t do much with that, but it distracts without adding value.  I do sort of like the vine creaping up the wall, even though it has nothing to do with the song, well maybe......  Sorry, but upon further review, I''m dropping the score slightly on this one.  From 7 to 6.   Swash', '2003-01-10 17:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(187062, 10606, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beutiful child! Beutiful blue eyes! Never heard of the song but I''ll take your word for it. It''s a nice snapshot.</td>', 'Beutiful child! Beutiful blue eyes! Never heard of the song but I''ll take your word for it. It''s a nice snapshot.', '2003-01-10 18:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(187063, 10597, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great looking house. I guess it''s in Alabama :) It''s cropped too close on the top, I need to see that little triangle part that you cropped off - cropping the side is OK it give the photo some compositional style. Now, go rake the leaves :)</td>', 'Great looking house. I guess it''s in Alabama :) It''s cropped too close on the top, I need to see that little triangle part that you cropped off - cropping the side is OK it give the photo some compositional style. Now, go rake the leaves :)', '2003-01-10 18:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(187066, 10621, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo! I translated the title and it fits this photo so well. Good job.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo! I translated the title and it fits this photo so well. Good job.', '2003-01-10 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(187068, 10447, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love it! A Kangaroo. I want to see a closer shot of the Kangaroo. It''s a little soft and lacks detail but cute anyway.</td>', 'I love it! A Kangaroo. I want to see a closer shot of the Kangaroo. It''s a little soft and lacks detail but cute anyway.', '2003-01-10 18:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(187075, 10432, 3846, '<td valign="top">Never heard this song, but photo is very clean a well focused</td>', 'Never heard this song, but photo is very clean a well focused', '2003-01-10 18:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(187076, 10349, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, what is the plant?  (just curious)  Neat rain drops.  I don''t see any rain falling (too chicken to get your camera wet!  Just kidding!)  It seems a little dark, maybe it''s just the background.   A few of the objects at the edges of the picture could be considered distracting, whatever, I don''t mind too much.  Really neat reflections in the rain drops!!  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute photo, what is the plant?  (just curious)  Neat rain drops.  I don''t see any rain falling (too chicken to get your camera wet!  Just kidding!)  It seems a little dark, maybe it''s just the background.   A few of the objects at the edges of the picture could be considered distracting, whatever, I don''t mind too much.  Really neat reflections in the rain drops!!  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 18:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(187078, 10454, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Choice for song -- congratulations on getting up early enough to take this photo! The sky is over exposed but the photo is still very beaufiful. I don''t know what camera you use but if you can add filters, a polarizer or a graduated ND filter would even out the exposure. I realy like the composition. The tree on the left is a wonderful part of the photo. Beautiful scene.</td>', 'Wonderful Choice for song -- congratulations on getting up early enough to take this photo! The sky is over exposed but the photo is still very beaufiful. I don''t know what camera you use but if you can add filters, a polarizer or a graduated ND filter would even out the exposure. I realy like the composition. The tree on the left is a wonderful part of the photo. Beautiful scene.', '2003-01-10 18:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(187079, 10582, 1005, '<td valign="top">A bit edgy for this crowd, don''t you think?  Very sharp, clear photo.  The blood on the fingers seems more convincing than that on the blade (wonder why?)  I don''t know the song, but I will take your word for it, esp. since you bothered to include the band name (thanks, that helped!)  7 Swash</td>', 'A bit edgy for this crowd, don''t you think?  Very sharp, clear photo.  The blood on the fingers seems more convincing than that on the blade (wonder why?)  I don''t know the song, but I will take your word for it, esp. since you bothered to include the band name (thanks, that helped!)  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 18:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(187082, 10601, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat picture.  I wish I could say I recognize the song title,  but I don''t.  Never fear, I don''t score down for my lack of knowledge!  The background is nice, but the lack of color compared to the foreground doesn''t seem like a good thing to me.  The tuplis/foreground is very, very nice.  7 Swash</td>', 'Neat picture.  I wish I could say I recognize the song title,  but I don''t.  Never fear, I don''t score down for my lack of knowledge!  The background is nice, but the lack of color compared to the foreground doesn''t seem like a good thing to me.  The tuplis/foreground is very, very nice.  7 Swash', '2003-01-10 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(187085, 10613, 1005, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, but....here''s my thoughts on The Wall pictures.  It''s a story, more about the man''s childhood than anything else and that time''s effect on his personality.  A mean old lady or scared child in front of this wall would make for a more complete story and stronger connection to the song.  I connected to The Wall entries strongly at first, just because of the song.  In my second viewing, the photo needs more, sorry, score downgrade from 7 to 6.  Swash</td>', 'Challenge met, but....here''s my thoughts on The Wall pictures.  It''s a story, more about the man''s childhood than anything else and that time''s effect on his personality.  A mean old lady or scared child in front of this wall would make for a more complete story and stronger connection to the song.  I connected to The Wall entries strongly at first, just because of the song.  In my second viewing, the photo needs more, sorry, score downgrade from 7 to 6.  Swash', '2003-01-10 18:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
