(187266, 10349, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs to be just a little lighter.  Like the contrast though.  Good capture.  PTL 7</td>', 'Needs to be just a little lighter.  Like the contrast though.  Good capture.  PTL 7', '2003-01-11 10:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
