(187269, 10578, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love how you captured his face.  Can''t say much bad.  The bird captures your eye and holds it there.  Good one.  8  PTL</td>', 'Love how you captured his face.  Can''t say much bad.  The bird captures your eye and holds it there.  Good one.  8  PTL', '2003-01-11 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(187270, 10532, 4648, '<td valign="top">A beautiful sunset will get you everytime.  The sky colors are fantastic.  My biggest problem is the 3 white patches with a small 4th one in the middle.  They take you away from the sky.  I would have rather you cropped them out and had more of the sky.  They are too distracting, way too distracting.  Other than them it is a wonderful shot.  PTL  6</td>', 'A beautiful sunset will get you everytime.  The sky colors are fantastic.  My biggest problem is the 3 white patches with a small 4th one in the middle.  They take you away from the sky.  I would have rather you cropped them out and had more of the sky.  They are too distracting, way too distracting.  Other than them it is a wonderful shot.  PTL  6', '2003-01-11 10:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(187271, 10409, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love this whole idea.  I don''t know what that is around the bottle, but I like it.  I love the whole compositin and your execution, especially the drop of tear in mid-air.  Great in my opinon.  PTL 8</td>', 'I love this whole idea.  I don''t know what that is around the bottle, but I like it.  I love the whole compositin and your execution, especially the drop of tear in mid-air.  Great in my opinon.  PTL 8', '2003-01-11 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(187272, 10529, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I don''t see anything here, not even modern art.  But''s that''s just me personally.  Can''t give it anything but a 1.  I can''t even make a good comment, not one that would help you improve it.  You obvious like it, and THAT IS NOT A PUT DOWN, and I don''t see anything here.  So I can''t help improve the photo.  PTL</td>', 'I''m sorry but I don''t see anything here, not even modern art.  But''s that''s just me personally.  Can''t give it anything but a 1.  I can''t even make a good comment, not one that would help you improve it.  You obvious like it, and THAT IS NOT A PUT DOWN, and I don''t see anything here.  So I can''t help improve the photo.  PTL', '2003-01-11 10:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(187273, 10639, 4648, '<td valign="top">My best suggestion would be to spray the socks with "shout" before washing them, and some bleach in the bleach cup.  Otherwise looks like a good load.  Also a good pic.  Nice focus, cropping, content, lighting.  Good job.  8  PTL</td>', 'My best suggestion would be to spray the socks with "shout" before washing them, and some bleach in the bleach cup.  Otherwise looks like a good load.  Also a good pic.  Nice focus, cropping, content, lighting.  Good job.  8  PTL', '2003-01-11 10:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(187275, 10418, 4648, '<td valign="top">Are these stairs really red and the center blue like this?  I love the circlular stairs and you captured them well in only a small section.  Good job.  Nice and bright.  The birghtness of the colors sure catch your eye.  Good job.  PTL 8</td>', 'Are these stairs really red and the center blue like this?  I love the circlular stairs and you captured them well in only a small section.  Good job.  Nice and bright.  The birghtness of the colors sure catch your eye.  Good job.  PTL 8', '2003-01-11 10:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
