(187299, 10432, 4648, '<td valign="top">10 for sense of humor.  10 for the way you think, originality in other words.  Laughing so hard when I scored it, I meant to give it a one and slid down to the 0 also and gave it a 10 by mistkake.  Now I''ll give you a 10 if you''ll cook them up and invite me over.   It''s not something I''ll hang on my livingroom wall, but it really does deserve a 10 for technicality and meeting the challenge.  Others will disagree, but that''s their problem.  You worked for this one.  Probably the only 10.  PTL</td>', '10 for sense of humor.  10 for the way you think, originality in other words.  Laughing so hard when I scored it, I meant to give it a one and slid down to the 0 also and gave it a 10 by mistkake.  Now I''ll give you a 10 if you''ll cook them up and invite me over.   It''s not something I''ll hang on my livingroom wall, but it really does deserve a 10 for technicality and meeting the challenge.  Others will disagree, but that''s their problem.  You worked for this one.  Probably the only 10.  PTL', '2003-01-11 12:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
