(187323, 10389, 2472, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and colors, great focus and transparency.</td>', 'Very nice image and colors, great focus and transparency.', '2003-01-11 15:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(187324, 10548, 2472, '<td valign="top">IMHO this is not original enough, and the flame is overexposed, loosing it''s desired effect, There is a lot of pixelation around the flare, which makes it feel out of focus. Even movement in a still image needs to be in focus, or at least the subject or part of it.</td>', 'IMHO this is not original enough, and the flame is overexposed, loosing it''s desired effect, There is a lot of pixelation around the flare, which makes it feel out of focus. Even movement in a still image needs to be in focus, or at least the subject or part of it.', '2003-01-11 15:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(187325, 10659, 2472, '<td valign="top">IMHO this is not original enough, and the flames are overexposed, loosing it\''s desired effect. It feels out of focus. Even movement in a still image needs to be in focus, or at least the subject or part of it.</td>', 'IMHO this is not original enough, and the flames are overexposed, loosing it\''s desired effect. It feels out of focus. Even movement in a still image needs to be in focus, or at least the subject or part of it.', '2003-01-11 15:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(187328, 10464, 2472, '<td valign="top">IMHO the placement of this shot resulted in an awkward angle for the cropping, which also left out the right edge of the cross. The focus is too soft, and the arm stretching in the lower center seems to have been cropped by accident, more than a compositional issue.</td>', 'IMHO the placement of this shot resulted in an awkward angle for the cropping, which also left out the right edge of the cross. The focus is too soft, and the arm stretching in the lower center seems to have been cropped by accident, more than a compositional issue.', '2003-01-11 15:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(187339, 10472, 5834, '<td valign="top">Maybe not the brand new idea but i like the shot :) The only think that bothers me a little is too many noise for this picture. (8)<br/></td>', 'Maybe not the brand new idea but i like the shot :) The only think that bothers me a little is too many noise for this picture. (8)', '2003-01-11 17:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(187345, 10446, 4517, '<td valign="top">The best candle shot this week. 9</td>', 'The best candle shot this week. 9', '2003-01-11 18:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(187346, 10651, 4517, '<td valign="top">Speaks for itself. 10</td>', 'Speaks for itself. 10', '2003-01-11 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(187350, 10455, 3087, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully emotive photo that was a 10 for me the second I saw it. It''s a shame we can''t click to add an image to our favourites during voting! I really like the simple content - the beautiful skin tone of the model and the crisp white linen. The heavily cropped composition, just including her smile but not the rest of her face or body, is very powerful. This fits the title and the singer 100 % as far as I am concerned and I think it''s an absolute winner.</td>', 'A wonderfully emotive photo that was a 10 for me the second I saw it. It''s a shame we can''t click to add an image to our favourites during voting! I really like the simple content - the beautiful skin tone of the model and the crisp white linen. The heavily cropped composition, just including her smile but not the rest of her face or body, is very powerful. This fits the title and the singer 100 % as far as I am concerned and I think it''s an absolute winner.', '2003-01-11 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(187352, 10366, 3087, '<td valign="top">Such a simple subject and yet such a strong photo. This gets a 10 from me because of it''s incredible detail and vibrancy. I want to reach out and touch it. I almost think I can smell it! The black background is very effective and I like the subtle use of DOF - only the stem in the lower corner is out of focus - spot on! Colour and lighting are excellent. This is the kind of image I can imagine people dismissing as cliched, or lacking in imagination, but I think it''s so excellently executed that it has very strong appeal regardless!</td>', 'Such a simple subject and yet such a strong photo. This gets a 10 from me because of it''s incredible detail and vibrancy. I want to reach out and touch it. I almost think I can smell it! The black background is very effective and I like the subtle use of DOF - only the stem in the lower corner is out of focus - spot on! Colour and lighting are excellent. This is the kind of image I can imagine people dismissing as cliched, or lacking in imagination, but I think it''s so excellently executed that it has very strong appeal regardless!', '2003-01-11 18:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(187353, 10479, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the way this image is life-sized - at least it is on my monitor!<br/>Very simple, holds my interest. I am often a fan of shallow DOF, and I like that the tip is a little out of focus, but I think my preference on this one would be for just a touch more DOF. <br/>9</td>', 'I really like the way this image is life-sized - at least it is on my monitor!Very simple, holds my interest. I am often a fan of shallow DOF, and I like that the tip is a little out of focus, but I think my preference on this one would be for just a touch more DOF. 9', '2003-01-11 18:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(187354, 10550, 5391, '<td valign="top">Clever idea - made me smile.</td>', 'Clever idea - made me smile.', '2003-01-11 18:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(187357, 10672, 3087, '<td valign="top">On first glance at this one I mentally scored it a little lower - it wasn''t until I looked again and saw the lady in the red coat that it really clicked for me as a stronger image. I like the water flow (slow shutter speed thing) as the whites it gives in the water complement the white of the snow. This is almost monotone and the red of the woman pulls it back into colour. I like that contrast. I think the position of the woman isn\''t ideal - she vies for attention with the tree trunk. 7, Kavey</td>', 'On first glance at this one I mentally scored it a little lower - it wasn''t until I looked again and saw the lady in the red coat that it really clicked for me as a stronger image. I like the water flow (slow shutter speed thing) as the whites it gives in the water complement the white of the snow. This is almost monotone and the red of the woman pulls it back into colour. I like that contrast. I think the position of the woman isn\''t ideal - she vies for attention with the tree trunk. 7, Kavey', '2003-01-11 18:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(187358, 10536, 2158, '<td valign="top">IMO this would have worked better with a plainer looking pie.  The pie and the background just seem to clash.  I love the idea though.</td>', 'IMO this would have worked better with a plainer looking pie.  The pie and the background just seem to clash.  I love the idea though.', '2003-01-11 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(187359, 10539, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image. I especially like the following : Hidden thumb, encircled pearl at lower right, splash of hair, nice use of lighting on pearls themselves, chioce to use just a portion of the neck region. That being said I personally find the shadows beneath the fingers and pearls a tad harsh. I would have liked the skin texture to be a little smoother...the pores and hairs although a fact of life take away the glamour edge for me. These are just very minor complaints that really don''t amount to a hill of beans for most folk ( so you can ignore them too). I really like your graphic composition. A clean technically impeccable image. This is one of my fav shots for this week. You should easily be in the top 10. Good luck1</td>', 'This is a wonderful image. I especially like the following : Hidden thumb, encircled pearl at lower right, splash of hair, nice use of lighting on pearls themselves, chioce to use just a portion of the neck region. That being said I personally find the shadows beneath the fingers and pearls a tad harsh. I would have liked the skin texture to be a little smoother...the pores and hairs although a fact of life take away the glamour edge for me. These are just very minor complaints that really don''t amount to a hill of beans for most folk ( so you can ignore them too). I really like your graphic composition. A clean technically impeccable image. This is one of my fav shots for this week. You should easily be in the top 10. Good luck1', '2003-01-11 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(187361, 10452, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very good shot - captures the essence of the song as well as being technically well done.</td>', 'Very good shot - captures the essence of the song as well as being technically well done.', '2003-01-11 19:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(187362, 10345, 5391, '<td valign="top">The soft-focus effect is beautiful and adds dramatically to the shot.  Very nice.</td>', 'The soft-focus effect is beautiful and adds dramatically to the shot.  Very nice.', '2003-01-11 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(187364, 10653, 5391, '<td valign="top">Brilliant color.</td>', 'Brilliant color.', '2003-01-11 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(187365, 10549, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mood and color.</td>', 'Beautiful mood and color.', '2003-01-11 19:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(187368, 10644, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is one of those classic image archetypes  that has been popular for ages. Although I have seen this many times before, it is just like the overwhelming power of a glorious sunrise. The heart skips a beat. The visual strength of red alone shouts strong here. The touches of a single petal, the blurred music page, just three black keys against lots of white, the extraordinary lovely lighting on the rose itself, the serrated leaf edge...these are some of the elements that really pull this magnificent work together for me. I say pump your ego with at least a dozen 10''s this week. Very well done!</td>', 'This is one of those classic image archetypes  that has been popular for ages. Although I have seen this many times before, it is just like the overwhelming power of a glorious sunrise. The heart skips a beat. The visual strength of red alone shouts strong here. The touches of a single petal, the blurred music page, just three black keys against lots of white, the extraordinary lovely lighting on the rose itself, the serrated leaf edge...these are some of the elements that really pull this magnificent work together for me. I say pump your ego with at least a dozen 10''s this week. Very well done!', '2003-01-11 19:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(187369, 10558, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait. The skin texture is superb. There is lots of darkness happening here which is key to your message. The unusual reflection in the sunglasses is a little complicated for my personal taste. I would like a more simple theme in the reflection. But that is me alone and not the other 100 voters. There is a hint of minor distraction in a different background tone beneath the chin. I would like just a litttle more breathing space beneath the chin. Although you may not agree, I think that a vertical crop and tossing away the left two thirds of the image would make an interesting outtake. Otherwise this is truly an inspiring image worthy of many compliments. Good luck!</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait. The skin texture is superb. There is lots of darkness happening here which is key to your message. The unusual reflection in the sunglasses is a little complicated for my personal taste. I would like a more simple theme in the reflection. But that is me alone and not the other 100 voters. There is a hint of minor distraction in a different background tone beneath the chin. I would like just a litttle more breathing space beneath the chin. Although you may not agree, I think that a vertical crop and tossing away the left two thirds of the image would make an interesting outtake. Otherwise this is truly an inspiring image worthy of many compliments. Good luck!', '2003-01-11 19:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(187371, 10684, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-01-11 19:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(187372, 10604, 5964, '<td valign="top">I am not one for any kind of abstract art and that follows into photograhy. I wouldl have enjoyed this much better with a crisp shot of a real or stuffed rabbit. I am sure you are trying to portray something but it just doesn''t work for me.5. Thanks for the explanation.<br/> <br/>Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo</td>', 'I am not one for any kind of abstract art and that follows into photograhy. I wouldl have enjoyed this much better with a crisp shot of a real or stuffed rabbit. I am sure you are trying to portray something but it just doesn''t work for me.5. Thanks for the explanation. Take my comments for what they are worth for I am just a novice with a new camera. Dodo', '2003-01-11 19:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
