(187396, 10552, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but I''d like to see the fire under less strong wind ... ie. slightly bent to one side.  would make for a softer feel.   Still a nice use of Black and White.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'I like the composition, but I''d like to see the fire under less strong wind ... ie. slightly bent to one side.  would make for a softer feel.   Still a nice use of Black and White.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-11 20:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
