(187400, 10599, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I like the way the flame contours the side of Marilyn''s face.  NIce border too.  Good job.  My second 10.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I like the way the flame contours the side of Marilyn''s face.  NIce border too.  Good job.  My second 10.  Good luck.', '2003-01-11 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
