(187516, 10611, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately 3 windows here.  I like the use of black and white. and the angle is good.  I''m glad it wasn''t taken at a direct angle.  The dark blob (tree, or shadow of a tree??) is a tad distracting and cuts into that second window, but your focus and clarity are great.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately 3 windows here.  I like the use of black and white. and the angle is good.  I''m glad it wasn''t taken at a direct angle.  The dark blob (tree, or shadow of a tree??) is a tad distracting and cuts into that second window, but your focus and clarity are great.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 12:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(187519, 10634, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouetted tree with the moon against that blue sky.  Focus seems ok, was it a bit windy?  cause the trunk looks better focus than the branches and the little hairy things near the bottom.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice.  Godd luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the silhouetted tree with the moon against that blue sky.  Focus seems ok, was it a bit windy?  cause the trunk looks better focus than the branches and the little hairy things near the bottom.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice.  Godd luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(187548, 10569, 3294, '<td valign="top">If that is under MY skin... I need to see a doctor!  hehe  I would have liked to see more of the green thing.  Seems like it was cropped short.  Also appears blurry, but I can imagine the difficulty in focusing that small of an object.  (7)</td>', 'If that is under MY skin... I need to see a doctor!  hehe  I would have liked to see more of the green thing.  Seems like it was cropped short.  Also appears blurry, but I can imagine the difficulty in focusing that small of an object.  (7)', '2003-01-12 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(187550, 10570, 3294, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo.  Nice use of the border as well.</td>', 'Very pretty photo.  Nice use of the border as well.', '2003-01-12 13:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
