(187586, 10695, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the execution is a bit off. The whole picture turned out really grainy, and half the collage is lit while the other half is dark. I understand the problems in lighting for I have not a studio set up and struggle with the same problem.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the execution is a bit off. The whole picture turned out really grainy, and half the collage is lit while the other half is dark. I understand the problems in lighting for I have not a studio set up and struggle with the same problem.', '2003-01-12 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
