(187604, 10476, 5983, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the washed out look.</td>', 'I enjoy the washed out look.', '2003-01-12 16:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(187606, 10457, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual angle of a familiar and oft-photographed monument! I believe that the strength of this image is down to the excellent and simple composition which really uses the Rule of Thirds very effectively. I love the near horizontal line across the lower third - it balances very well against the curved vertical of the tower. The intensity of the light against the deep blueness of the sky is also very striking. 9, Kavey</td>', 'What an unusual angle of a familiar and oft-photographed monument! I believe that the strength of this image is down to the excellent and simple composition which really uses the Rule of Thirds very effectively. I love the near horizontal line across the lower third - it balances very well against the curved vertical of the tower. The intensity of the light against the deep blueness of the sky is also very striking. 9, Kavey', '2003-01-12 16:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
