(187757, 10452, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like the board under glass with the pieces on top...  It makes the king seem like it is floating.  The only thing I don''t like about it is the checkerboard pattern reflection.  Lighting, DOF, focus, basically all technical aspects are perfect.  Nice shot. 8</td>', 'I like the board under glass with the pieces on top...  It makes the king seem like it is floating.  The only thing I don''t like about it is the checkerboard pattern reflection.  Lighting, DOF, focus, basically all technical aspects are perfect.  Nice shot. 8', '2003-01-12 19:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
