(187759, 10345, 1647, '<td valign="top">The photo is slightly blurred / out of focus.  This is no doubt a result of the low light, possibly combined with a hand-held shot.  Your framing is good and it''s a lovely shot.  You should try it again with a tripod, or resting the camera on something (and a broom handle perhaps).  It could make a lovely photo if exposed correctly and slightly more  in focus.</td>', 'The photo is slightly blurred / out of focus.  This is no doubt a result of the low light, possibly combined with a hand-held shot.  Your framing is good and it''s a lovely shot.  You should try it again with a tripod, or resting the camera on something (and a broom handle perhaps).  It could make a lovely photo if exposed correctly and slightly more  in focus.', '2003-01-12 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
