(187762, 10465, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately a good interpretation of the song.  THe focus is a tad soft for my personal taste.  The background is really good for this shot.  Nothing distracting.  Lighting appears to be ok.  Wish we could see his eyes a bit more.  GOod luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately a good interpretation of the song.  THe focus is a tad soft for my personal taste.  The background is really good for this shot.  Nothing distracting.  Lighting appears to be ok.  Wish we could see his eyes a bit more.  GOod luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 19:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(187763, 10576, 4805, '<td valign="top">The fence on the right hand side cuts into the house a bit, I''d have taken the shot a bit more to the left I think. It''s always challenging to shoot into the light source but you''ve managed to keep the detail in the shadows, for the most part.  If I had to hazard a guess, this looks like PTMAN''s work...?? Seems Australian to me! Nice clarity to the shot.</td>', 'The fence on the right hand side cuts into the house a bit, I''d have taken the shot a bit more to the left I think. It''s always challenging to shoot into the light source but you''ve managed to keep the detail in the shadows, for the most part.  If I had to hazard a guess, this looks like PTMAN''s work...?? Seems Australian to me! Nice clarity to the shot.', '2003-01-12 19:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(187764, 10619, 3080, '<td valign="top">Some scary looking people.  Definately looks pink floyd-ish.  Angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  The focus and clarity are also very good.  Lighting is just fine, no blown out spots or distracting shadows.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Some scary looking people.  Definately looks pink floyd-ish.  Angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  The focus and clarity are also very good.  Lighting is just fine, no blown out spots or distracting shadows.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 19:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
