(187772, 10472, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is so cool!!  I need to get me one of those wooden drawing poser guys, although I don''t think I could be nearly as creative as this!  The pose is awesome, the lighting is amazing!  You have given this inanimate object some great human character!  Your subject placement is perfect.  I initially gave this an 8 on my initial voting, but since I can''t find any way to improve the image it must be a 10.  One of my favorites this week (and only 10).  Great job!<br/> <br/>Smellyfish1002</td>', 'This is so cool!!  I need to get me one of those wooden drawing poser guys, although I don''t think I could be nearly as creative as this!  The pose is awesome, the lighting is amazing!  You have given this inanimate object some great human character!  Your subject placement is perfect.  I initially gave this an 8 on my initial voting, but since I can''t find any way to improve the image it must be a 10.  One of my favorites this week (and only 10).  Great job! Smellyfish1002', '2003-01-12 19:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
