(187788, 10696, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately a photo of ice.  I take your word for it that it''s a song.  I think that the white on the right branch is a tad washed out, kind of too white.  I am not a huge fan of the long exposure water, however, you have done it quite well.  Technically, it''s just fine, just not my personal preference.  I like the blue cast to the photo.  I get the same thing when I''m taking pics outside when there is snow.  not quite sure why it does that, but I like it that way.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately a photo of ice.  I take your word for it that it''s a song.  I think that the white on the right branch is a tad washed out, kind of too white.  I am not a huge fan of the long exposure water, however, you have done it quite well.  Technically, it''s just fine, just not my personal preference.  I like the blue cast to the photo.  I get the same thing when I''m taking pics outside when there is snow.  not quite sure why it does that, but I like it that way.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(187789, 10554, 4805, '<td valign="top">I  really like the top 2/3rds of the shot, lovely colours and tones. The trees are a bit of a problem, though...I think the tree behind the cross encroaches on it a bit too much for the cross to really stand out. I like how they converge on the spot but I think it''d have been more effective from a lower angle, getting the sun to shine from the cross'' intersection.</td>', 'I  really like the top 2/3rds of the shot, lovely colours and tones. The trees are a bit of a problem, though...I think the tree behind the cross encroaches on it a bit too much for the cross to really stand out. I like how they converge on the spot but I think it''d have been more effective from a lower angle, getting the sun to shine from the cross'' intersection.', '2003-01-12 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
