(187890, 10606, 3080, '<td valign="top">The background here is way washed out.  That is kind of distracting from the girl.  Pretty baby blues though!  Your focus and clarity are great.  Lighting on the girl is also great.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok, I would have liked to have seen her whole head though.  Otherwise, nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The background here is way washed out.  That is kind of distracting from the girl.  Pretty baby blues though!  Your focus and clarity are great.  Lighting on the girl is also great.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok, I would have liked to have seen her whole head though.  Otherwise, nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(187892, 10539, 3080, '<td valign="top">Fits the song perfectly.  Your focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping is nice to accent the necklace, which is a very important part of the photo due to the challenge.  I don''t mind at all here, that you have cropped her hand and head.  I think it works.  Lighting is quite nice for the photo as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Fits the song perfectly.  Your focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping is nice to accent the necklace, which is a very important part of the photo due to the challenge.  I don''t mind at all here, that you have cropped her hand and head.  I think it works.  Lighting is quite nice for the photo as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(187893, 10389, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp. I like the colors, and I like how it is all positioned within the frame.  The mirror is great.  It puts a kind of symetry to the whole thing.  Focus and clarity are just awesome.  I also like the border.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice and sharp. I like the colors, and I like how it is all positioned within the frame.  The mirror is great.  It puts a kind of symetry to the whole thing.  Focus and clarity are just awesome.  I also like the border.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(187894, 10479, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your DOF is very small.  I think I would have liked to have seen this whole thing in focus.  The photo fits the title.  I''ve never heard of the song, but I''ll take your word for it.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  I like the way it is positioned in the frame.  The lighting is good, and background is not distracting in any way.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your DOF is very small.  I think I would have liked to have seen this whole thing in focus.  The photo fits the title.  I''ve never heard of the song, but I''ll take your word for it.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice.  I like the way it is positioned in the frame.  The lighting is good, and background is not distracting in any way.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(187895, 10613, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately fits the challenge, and the song very well.  The subject however isn''t really exciting.  Technically, it''s well done.  The focus and clarity are good, and lighting appears to be good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately fits the challenge, and the song very well.  The subject however isn''t really exciting.  Technically, it''s well done.  The focus and clarity are good, and lighting appears to be good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(187896, 10565, 3080, '<td valign="top">I assume this is a pinhole kind of thing.  I think it would look great, however it''s quite grainy and that doesn''t really appeal to me.  There really isn''t much more to the photo than the grainy dot.  I think I would have prefered if this were off to one side or another, dead center doesn''t really work for this in my opinion.  It is a really cool effect though, however you did this, it does look like a planet.  Almost makes me wonder IS this a planet?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I assume this is a pinhole kind of thing.  I think it would look great, however it''s quite grainy and that doesn''t really appeal to me.  There really isn''t much more to the photo than the grainy dot.  I think I would have prefered if this were off to one side or another, dead center doesn''t really work for this in my opinion.  It is a really cool effect though, however you did this, it does look like a planet.  Almost makes me wonder IS this a planet?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(187897, 10571, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the reason for having the person in the photo, other than to make it so this wasn''t JUST a photo of a wall.  I supose it would be a very boring photo without something else in it.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how he is sitting off to the right side.  The focus and clarity are ok as well.  I am assuming that the shadow and hood pulled over the face is intentional.  I think it works well. (and I don''t say that often about shadows on faces).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t see the reason for having the person in the photo, other than to make it so this wasn''t JUST a photo of a wall.  I supose it would be a very boring photo without something else in it.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how he is sitting off to the right side.  The focus and clarity are ok as well.  I am assuming that the shadow and hood pulled over the face is intentional.  I think it works well. (and I don''t say that often about shadows on faces).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(187898, 10602, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful sky.  I really like the color there.  The color of the bottom of the photo though (car lights?) doesn''t really appeal to me though.  Definately portrays a lonely night.  You did a great job capturing that.  The angle and framing/cropping is good, I think it looks ok if you were to crop a bit of the bottom off too.  I like the silhouetted trees.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very beautiful sky.  I really like the color there.  The color of the bottom of the photo though (car lights?) doesn''t really appeal to me though.  Definately portrays a lonely night.  You did a great job capturing that.  The angle and framing/cropping is good, I think it looks ok if you were to crop a bit of the bottom off too.  I like the silhouetted trees.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(187899, 10418, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really cool stairs.  I like the red on blue, really nice.  Definately portrays the title.  lighting is great, as is the focus and clarity.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  The strong diagonal is really great.  This is an excelent shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really cool stairs.  I like the red on blue, really nice.  Definately portrays the title.  lighting is great, as is the focus and clarity.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  The strong diagonal is really great.  This is an excelent shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(187906, 10512, 3080, '<td valign="top">Too bad the upper balcony is up there in the shot.  You couldn''t just move it?  hehe just kidding.  Shots inside public places are sometimes really hard to get cause of other things in the way, and not being able to control the environment.  The colors seem kind of muted here, I wonder how a tad more saturation would have made this look.  Your focus and clarity are awesome. I love the detail in his skin.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Too bad the upper balcony is up there in the shot.  You couldn''t just move it?  hehe just kidding.  Shots inside public places are sometimes really hard to get cause of other things in the way, and not being able to control the environment.  The colors seem kind of muted here, I wonder how a tad more saturation would have made this look.  Your focus and clarity are awesome. I love the detail in his skin.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-12 21:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(187914, 10618, 3575, '<td valign="top">I really love this photograph. I think if I didn''t have your title to go by I would have guessed it. Super job.</td>', 'I really love this photograph. I think if I didn''t have your title to go by I would have guessed it. Super job.', '2003-01-12 22:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(187915, 10625, 3575, '<td valign="top">Is this really the Nile? It''s wonderful!</td>', 'Is this really the Nile? It''s wonderful!', '2003-01-12 22:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(187916, 10451, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oh my God. The composition is wonderful. I don''t know the song but your photo is so emotive and the eyes, well, they are showing a lot of pain for some reason. -10</td>', 'Oh my God. The composition is wonderful. I don''t know the song but your photo is so emotive and the eyes, well, they are showing a lot of pain for some reason. -10', '2003-01-12 22:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(187917, 10455, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and exposure. Risky cropping off half her head but that it definately and artistic expression.  Next time though, don''t crop off the little finger. I have to give you a 9 for this one. Amazing and what a beautiful women.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and exposure. Risky cropping off half her head but that it definately and artistic expression.  Next time though, don''t crop off the little finger. I have to give you a 9 for this one. Amazing and what a beautiful women.', '2003-01-12 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(187919, 10671, 4648, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have cropped out more of the sky.  I don''t feel it adds to the photo.  The focus is really good, the colors are great, composition i nice, I wish you hadn''t cropped it so tightly on the left and left space on the right.  Would have centered the boy more.  Still a beautiful shot.  PTL 7</td>', 'Personally I would have cropped out more of the sky.  I don''t feel it adds to the photo.  The focus is really good, the colors are great, composition i nice, I wish you hadn''t cropped it so tightly on the left and left space on the right.  Would have centered the boy more.  Still a beautiful shot.  PTL 7', '2003-01-12 22:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(187922, 10405, 3575, '<td valign="top">I Love Prince. I couldn''t figure out how to do Purple Rain, This is great. Can''t tell what that object is though.</td>', 'I Love Prince. I couldn''t figure out how to do Purple Rain, This is great. Can''t tell what that object is though.', '2003-01-12 22:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(187923, 10349, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeousl macro. Wonderfully sharp with great DOF. Good work.</td>', 'Gorgeousl macro. Wonderfully sharp with great DOF. Good work.', '2003-01-12 22:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(187924, 10606, 4648, '<td valign="top">Background a little too bight on the right at her head.  Shouldn''t have cropped off the top of her head.  Otherwise a beautiful photo.  Her expression is beautiful.  She looks like she''s in her own lilltle world.  Beautiful.  PTL 7</td>', 'Background a little too bight on the right at her head.  Shouldn''t have cropped off the top of her head.  Otherwise a beautiful photo.  Her expression is beautiful.  She looks like she''s in her own lilltle world.  Beautiful.  PTL 7', '2003-01-12 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(187925, 10554, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful placement of the sun and cross in this shot. Very moving.</td>', 'Wonderful placement of the sun and cross in this shot. Very moving.', '2003-01-12 22:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(187926, 10594, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very moving. Well done. I love the compositin and the background is very interesting.</td>', 'Very moving. Well done. I love the compositin and the background is very interesting.', '2003-01-12 22:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
