(188070, 10684, 674, '<td valign="top">Thank-you all who commented and voted on this photo! It was taken using a hoya R72 filter on the camera and I used auto levels,brightnes and contrast and hue and saturation in minimal ammounts. The camera was in colour mode aperture priority and I leave the iso set to 100 if I want to get this effect.</td>', 'Thank-you all who commented and voted on this photo! It was taken using a hoya R72 filter on the camera and I used auto levels,brightnes and contrast and hue and saturation in minimal ammounts. The camera was in colour mode aperture priority and I leave the iso set to 100 if I want to get this effect.', '2003-01-13 00:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
