(188443, 10663, 5964, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. I personally like the man in the mirror out of focus for none of us knows for sure what our future is (the fuzziness was my way of showing that) Well that and there is not enough light nor room in our kitchen, which is also why the image in the mirror was so close otherwise everyone could view my nice wooden cupboards.<br/> <br/>   Again thanks for the comments<br/>   Dodo</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. I personally like the man in the mirror out of focus for none of us knows for sure what our future is (the fuzziness was my way of showing that) Well that and there is not enough light nor room in our kitchen, which is also why the image in the mirror was so close otherwise everyone could view my nice wooden cupboards.    Again thanks for the comments   Dodo', '2003-01-13 04:02:02.000000', NULL, 0),
