(188821, 10370, 2764, '<td valign="top">Well I was the only nine - I think this picture is way under rated!</td>', 'Well I was the only nine - I think this picture is way under rated!', '2003-01-13 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(188914, 10492, 5521, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for you comments. To be honest, I haven''t heard the song either ;). I took the photo first and searched for a title later.<br/>To make the photo I wrapped a pen light with a black fabric so that only the lighted tip was showing, then I placed a blue glass marble on top of the tip. I placed my camera in a tripod and set a exposure of 15 seconds. I exposed the ball for 5 seconds to create the head of the comet and then slowly started panning to create the tail.</td>', 'Thanks everybody for you comments. To be honest, I haven''t heard the song either ;). I took the photo first and searched for a title later.To make the photo I wrapped a pen light with a black fabric so that only the lighted tip was showing, then I placed a blue glass marble on top of the tip. I placed my camera in a tripod and set a exposure of 15 seconds. I exposed the ball for 5 seconds to create the head of the comet and then slowly started panning to create the tail.', '2003-01-13 12:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(188957, 10653, 2361, '<td valign="top">Well done, Grayce!  A wonderful shot with your usual excellent handling of colours.</td>', 'Well done, Grayce!  A wonderful shot with your usual excellent handling of colours.', '2003-01-13 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
