(188977, 10443, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gracious:</b></div><hr/><i>John,  This is the song my husband and I wanted for our first dance, at our wedding.  It was a little complicated for a quartet, so we settled on Color My World, by Chicago.  Moody Blues were our favorite group though.<br/>Good image.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Gee...I always found it relatively easy to play...if you''re interested I''ll post a couple of versions you can download -- send me an email.<br/> <br/>John, beautiful photo. The actual title is spelled "Nights" but I also would have named this photo as you did...</td>', 'Originally posted by Gracious:John,  This is the song my husband and I wanted for our first dance, at our wedding.  It was a little complicated for a quartet, so we settled on Color My World, by Chicago.  Moody Blues were our favorite group though.Good image. Gee...I always found it relatively easy to play...if you''re interested I''ll post a couple of versions you can download -- send me an email. John, beautiful photo. The actual title is spelled "Nights" but I also would have named this photo as you did...', '2003-01-13 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
