(189017, 10479, 2130, '<td valign="top">wow, I thought this one would do a lot better...I love the focus...the light and the cool idea...should have finished in the top 10s...oh and ppl are always telling me to put the whole thing in focus..specially the front part of it...don''t listen..this is way more interesting</td>', 'wow, I thought this one would do a lot better...I love the focus...the light and the cool idea...should have finished in the top 10s...oh and ppl are always telling me to put the whole thing in focus..specially the front part of it...don''t listen..this is way more interesting', '2003-01-13 14:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
