(193893, 10595, 5121, '<td valign="top">Well captured! Macro is my favourite subject so I appreciate how tough a shot like this one is to take, I applaude you. When you get a chance take a look at my macro album at www.picturetrail.com/freezethemoment I''d welcome your critique.</td>', 'Well captured! Macro is my favourite subject so I appreciate how tough a shot like this one is to take, I applaude you. When you get a chance take a look at my macro album at www.picturetrail.com/freezethemoment I''d welcome your critique.', '2003-01-18 11:47:47.000000', NULL, 0),
