(193896, 10558, 5121, '<td valign="top">I LOVE IT! Great border and a great picture. I had to smile to myself when I saw the comment a certain (ex) member left you in block capitals. I''ve never known such a contrary guy! Got a similar comment in block caps on one of my pix from him. Good riddance!</td>', 'I LOVE IT! Great border and a great picture. I had to smile to myself when I saw the comment a certain (ex) member left you in block capitals. I''ve never known such a contrary guy! Got a similar comment in block caps on one of my pix from him. Good riddance!', '2003-01-18 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
